 very professional, efficient, and friendly. They even swept the basement floor in their work area! I have used Highlights Chicago before and will continue to use them and recommend them. Thanks for a great job.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xKMGRqRTVPV1YyZWsxc01HNHRibTlrVTA1M1YzYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOlJ0djE5OWV2ek1sMG4tbm9kU053V3c%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "David Wiggs", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2025-12-02T22:29:39Z", review: "Raul and Oscar were punctual and efficient when installing a new outlet behind my TV. They were able to do it without cutting any drywall! While there were certainly quicker ways of accomplishing the task, they both had my best interest in mind as a homeowner. I will certainly be back should I need any other electrical work completed 🙏", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2psMFR6bG9TM1JwWWxWdGIwOUlNMnB4TnpBemQwRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOjl0TzloS3RpYlVtb09IM2pxNzAzd0E%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Ekemini Essien Gerdel", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2026-03-17T19:49:16Z", review: "I had Highlights Chicago out to hang a light fixture and to move a light switch from one wall to another.  The booking process was smooth and they arrived on the early side of the time frame they gave.  The workers were friendly, and knowledgeable, they were able to troubleshoot and fix issues that came up on the spot.  They went above what I was expecting.  I will definitely work with them again.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tGTlVFWlFWbU5mYkRCcFRHeElRVTB4Vm5rMFpHYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOkFNUEZQVmNfbDBpTGxIQU0xVnk0ZGc%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Eric Ferring", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2024-01-23T21:10:33Z", review: "HIGHLY recommended. We had five ceiling fans replaced, old ones hauled away, a ceiling fan switch replaced, and a rewiring of a very annoying kitchen light switch.  Jube and Martin were incredibly kind, communicative, and quick! The scheduling process was easy and also scheduled soon after.  We will go to highlights for all of our electrical needs! 5/5!", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURObWN5bjZ3RRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDNmcyn6wE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Emma LaBounty", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2025-12-05T13:36:30Z", review: "Raul and Oscar did a great job installing some new light switches for us, as well as helping with installation of a fixture. They found some unique challenges/ways we had to adjust, including the need to open up the wall more than we might have expected given some issues with our boxes. Along the way, Raoul was very communicative about what we needed to do, pros and cons, and what he would recommend, which allowed us to make good decisions in real time.  Leading up to the appointment, Boz and Iva were also very communicative in quickly getting us a quote and understanding exactly what we wanted done. I was very happy with their communication and how quickly we were able to get our project done. Will definitely reach out again for future needs.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tsWWJtaHRjRjh6Y0dsSVJWSkhkMlI1YlRreU1FRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOklYbmhtcF8zcGlIRVJHd2R5bTkyMEE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "K Jay", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2026-05-26T20:09:25Z", review: "Installed chandelier. Arrived on time. Very helpful advice. Courteous, professional, quick and clean service. Will definitely hire them for other projects. Making an appointment was also a pleasure. Worked hard to accommodate our schedule. Thank you!", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pFd2ExVjBZVmRCYVhwb2NqQnpXbFIyVDJONWVYYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOjEwa1V0YVdBaXpocjBzWlR2T2N5eXc%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Lida Downey", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2022-08-26T22:44:45Z", review: "I highly recommend Boz and Highlights Chicago for any challenging custom electrical installation projects that might be on your horizon! Professional, efficient, adaptable & knowledgeable are words that come to mind when describing the electricians of Highlights Chicago! After receiving several quotes for the replacement of two light fixtures, one that hung 20 ft. up in the foyer and the other that hung 17 ft. up in the primary bedroom, I chose Highlights Chicago for the job based in large part on several strong recommendations. Boz came through with his dream team of Raul, Gustavo & Christian. Original plan - use a 20' ladder for the foyer install but at 7:15 am this past Wednesday morning, the ladder quickly proved too large for the narrow foyer space. Undaunted, the crew came back the same morning and at 9:45 am, set about quickly building a 20' scaffold in the space to remove an old, wrought iron fixture that had come with the house and installing an antique store find in its place. Watching the progress, I was impressed with the speed, knowledge & teamwork that the three electricians displayed. Also, maneuvering 20 ft. up on the somewhat precarious scaffold was no easy feat, but the crew made it look effortless. Once the foyer job was finished, the scaffold was dismantled and brought up to the 2nd floor primary bedroom in order to remove an old ceiling fan that hung 17 ft. above. Down came the ceiling fan & up went the new chandelier and its numerous crystals that the team put together & hung while 12 ft. in the air. Both installs were finished by 1:45 pm, and the crew left the home spotless and the new light fixtures gleaming. Well done! I will definitely use Highlights Chicago for future rehab projects in both my real estate & interior design businesses! Thank you Highlights Chicago!", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUR1N1lqMWJBEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDu7Yj1bA%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Sarah", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2026-04-18T22:49:54Z", review: "Had them install my Tesla charger, was so fast and super well done. Now I have them over for any electrical issues. Usually they get someone out within the week to fix whatever you might need. Highly recommend!", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tGamJYaFBaR1JMTlhaV1EyTlZSREJVUjJsdU1XYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOkFjbXhPZGRLNXZWQ2NVRDBUR2luMWc%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "J Stinton", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2025-08-23T17:21:43Z", review: "I had an excellent experience with Highlights Chicago from start to finish. Boz came out for the initial inspection and provided a detailed, well-written proposal for my HOA board. Out of the four proposals I received, theirs was not only the most professional but also the most fairly priced.  On installation day, the team showed up early, worked efficiently, and was minimally disruptive throughout the process. The quality of work was outstanding—they left everything spotless, as if no work had ever been done, except now I have a perfectly installed EV charger.  A huge shoutout to Cristobal and Cesar for their precision and professionalism in getting the install done right the first time. Everything about this experience was smooth, transparent, and reliable. I would absolutely recommend Highlights Chicago to anyone looking for electrical work or EV charger installation.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21sb1NUZDBZVzlHWkV4bllrWndNRWh1T0V4WlJuYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOmloSTd0YW9GZExnYkZwMEhuOExZRnc%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Nancy French", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2025-05-21T19:43:36Z", review: "I can't say enough good things about our experience with Highlights Chicago Installing a large, heavy light fixture in a tall-ceilinged room in a high-rise is no small feat, but they handled it with absolute ease, confidence, and class. From the moment they arrived, they were calm, prepared, and focused. They took every safety precaution seriously, navigated the space skillfully, and managed the entire install with quiet efficiency. The fixture was not only installed perfectly--it looks like it was always meant to be there. Their attention to detail and pride in their work really showed!", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VMVDJqOGUzLVBpWURnEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKELT2j8e3-PiYDg%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Kira Kurka", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2023-08-05T20:02:41Z", review: "Outstanding professionalism from the Highlights team! For this client, Highlights needed to go into the ceilings because of the old cloth wire. The knowledge Boz had was unparalleled; it was out with the old & in with the new transformers & LED. I really appreciate that Raul & the guys protected the furniture & artwork. Considering that the glass was 1K a piece, they took all the precautions & I knew we chose the right business. I highly recommend Highlights, best in the city!", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNwOGNib2p3RRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICp8cbojwE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Leslie Scott", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2025-08-15T16:43:01Z", review: "I was blessed to have found this company. They were extremely reasonable and the quality was excellent.  It  begins with the  kindness & professionalism of the reception then the on time service with very qualified electricians.  The work was finished perfectly and the gentlemen were so wonderful.   I will always use them and refer them to my friends with confidence.   the job was completed for less money than I thought as they think outside the box.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT20xa2RFZHNhM1V4UjBkVVFVWkJhV2Q0WjJGRVgxRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOm1kdEdsa3UxR0dUQUZBaWd4Z2FEX1E%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Lea Xu", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2025-04-09T21:47:59Z", review: "Juan and Geda did an amazing job installing the Tesla charger for us. They showed up on time and covered the floors before work starts. Very professional during the whole installation! They were willing to make some adjustments to fit the cover box on the wall. Overall, Super neat work and cleaned up everything afterwards. Highly recommended ! On top of that, Boz gave us a free quote before the actual work, and the quote is very reasonable, no hidden charges like some companies out there.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTURJenVuYUF3EAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgMDIzunaAw%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "L G", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2026-02-07T14:31:53Z", review: "We had two new 240 circuits installed. The warm and friendly owner (Boz) came and explained the best way to proceed, and sent us an estimate later the same day. The personable work crew (Cristóbal, Oscar, and César) worked conscientiously, keeping the dust to a minimum, explaining the work, and making the whole project go smoothly. Big thanks to all of them! Highly recommended!", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2w5WVNXZHlOVFZVTFdGcFNETldUV1JIYzJOWlJWRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOl9YSWdyNTVULWFpSDNWTWRHc2NZRVE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Marcel", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2025-09-18T04:01:45Z", review: "I find that it's not easy to find good service providers in downtown Chicago, but Boz and Highlights Chicago are certainly among the best!  I needed to install a Tesla EV charger connected to my building's grid and have an submeter to track energy consumption. While others were quoting exorbitant prices or even deeming the project impossible, Boz made the discussions very straightforward and provided a reasonable quote. The team provided the required certificate of liability insurance on the same day I requested, I got the project approved by my building's association and had the installation scheduled.  The execution was on point! The team arrived at the exact time scheduled, with everything they needed and perfectly installed my charger as requested, all with proper care, safety and cleanliness. Shout out to Boz, Iva, Kaplan, Gerardo, Cristian and Matthew, a super team of super experts! I'll definitely recommend their services to others in my building and friends.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pRd1NrcGtRMlpyZDA5SWNTMTRjbXh0VkZGWlZWRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOjQwSkpkQ2Zrd09IcS14cmxtVFFZVVE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Brian Ortiz", rating: "1.0", iso_date: "2026-03-25T19:03:48Z", review: "We exchanged several emails discussing projects at my home. We scheduled a site visit.  But the company did not call or show up during our scheduled appt time.  I had to reach them, to learn they needed to reschedule.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tGd1FuRkNka3gxY1RGNlNWbE1SRmRSVFhKbmNrRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOkFwQnFCdkx1cTF6SVlMRFdRTXJnckE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Natalia Kashchuk", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2026-02-06T03:49:21Z", review: "We have used Highlights for our apartment in Chicago when the dishwasher lost power. The technician came right away, he was very professional and fixed everything in about half an hour.Juve was very helpful and Anna helped with scheduling and provided all the information we needed. Will use them again.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xSSk5rMXdSbnAyWjAxVVExSnlaa05wZVU1eFEyYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOlRJNk1wRnp2Z01UQ1JyZkNpeU5xQ2c%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "jennifer diprova", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2025-07-11T21:44:43Z", review: "A very good first experience with this company....so good that I plan on using them exclusively for all electrical needs.  Boz was very easy to work with; professional,  serious, and knowledgeable.   I loved my crew; Ben, Christian, and Gig..they were efficient, friendly,  and respected my home.  Look no further, this is the company you want!", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2s5dlV6TjRlSGRpVVdRNFJrWTRNMlZSTFdsNWMyYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOk9vUzN4eHdiUWQ4RkY4M2VRLWl5c2c%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Hatti T", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2025-01-31T18:17:13Z", review: "I had probably the best service anyone can ever have!! Raul and Louise were prompt on time excellent communicators, very helpful assistant towards explaining in detail about the issue and concerns for future issues! I am blown away by their authenticity and efficiency to get the job done in a timely manner!!! I plan to continue doing some electrical remodeling and will absolutely request Raul and Luis for all of my future needs electrically! Beyond happy!!!!", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUNBdHYzRnVRRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgMCAtv3FuQE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Katherine Smailis", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2025-11-27T03:33:15Z", review: 'It is quite hard to find "good" contract work. It is even harder to find "good" contract work done by really nice and genuine people. Juve and Marin, two electricians from Highlights Chicago, came to complete a project at my property and they were absolutely delightful. They were respectful and aware of all of the rules that needed to be followed in high rise buildings, they were extremely patient navigating the tough parking situation, elevator challenges, and back and forth trips to bring materials and tools from their vehicles to the 4th floor unit. They spent ample time not only answering all of my questions but walking me through the process so that I was becoming educated about what was happening along the way. They did a phenomenal job with the actual electrical work, replacing a full electrical panel, several outlets in the kitchen and bathroom, and moving light fixtures. They go above and beyond what you would expect for electrical work. To add to the great experience,  Bozidar, the managing director at Highlights, was exceptional in following the progression of the project with kindness and expertise.  I am so pleased with the care and craftsmanship the entire team provided. I would highly recommend using them for all of your electrical needs. Very grateful! Thank you, Highlights!', review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT210V2QyZDNZVTVRZEhka2FrUklSVzlNTFZCMlpuYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOmtWd2d3YU5QdHdkakRIRW9MLVB2Znc%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "katherine lehman", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2025-09-23T15:10:01Z", review: "We had a great experience with Highlights Chicago. They installed new electric in our 2-flat renovation. Juve was our point person and I really enjoyed working with him. He was responsive, professional and detail-oriented. Martin and Christian worked on the project as well and did great work. They installed our lights as well including chandeliers and sconces they expertly put together and hung. The pricing was transparent from the beginning and reasonable. Boss Boz was friendly and made everything straight forward to get done. I highly recommend this company for projects big or small.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2toaWJXOVVUbDlHVXpBMVZXZHBVMVpMV2tobFUzYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOkhibW9UTl9GUzA1VWdpU1ZLWkhlU3c%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "ryan dorty", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2026-02-18T16:12:09Z", review: "Did a commercial space for us in Skokie, the highlights did amazing work. Pulled a permit and dealed with the village. The village came and inspected and everything was great! Thanks so much to highlights team! Highly recommend", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tKemVFRjRMVmhVYm5CMmREVlpkalI0YlZVeVdrRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOkJzeEF4LVhUbnB2dDVZdjR4bVUyWkE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Kelly Luchtman", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2025-11-12T23:43:58Z", review: "I needed to upgrade my electrical service from the pole to the house. ComEd would not do it until I got updated risers and weatherheads on my front house and my coach house. Highlights came recommended from a friend. They were great! Boz came out the day after I called to give me a quote, and we were scheduled within a week. The guys were polite and clean and got the work done a few hours earlier than they said. The best part was I didn't have to deal with ComEd at all-Highlights handled everything and now I have updated, safe electrical service! Highly recommended.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xGemNtdHNkRUl6UmtodlFXVnhNalpYYldsT1ZrRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOlFzcmtsdEIzRkhvQWVxMjZXbWlOVkE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Haris Jasarevic", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2026-04-15T23:33:22Z", review: "Hoghlight Chicago did my 