 in the winter.  ***update 2025***  This is my second time leaving a review for Boz and his crew at Highlight Chicago because they continue to deliver above and beyond.  Most recently, they installed two high-powered LED security lights in our parking area along with five code-approved RAB vaporproof outdoor fixtures on our porches. The difference in safety and visibility at night is tremendous. He also handled the installation of string lights on our first-floor balcony, and the results turned out exactly how I wanted. Everything looks professional, well-planned, and adds both security and charm to our building ￼.  Boz runs a top-notch operation—his workers are always polite, respectful, and leave the job site spotless. They go out of their way to make sure the customer is happy, which is rare to find in this business. Pricing is always fair and transparent, and most importantly, they always deliver on the job they’re doing!  I wish I could find a plumber as good as the electrician I’ve found in This company haha  If you’re in Chicago and need electrical work done—whether it’s security lighting, porch upgrades, or detailed code-compliant installations—Highlight Chicago is hands-down the company you want to call.  Thank you!", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNXeGR6OGRnEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICWxdz8dg%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Beth Spargo", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2025-11-25T21:43:09Z", review: "During an inspection for our home remodel we discovered our electrical panel wasn’t properly grounded according to current code. We reached out to Highlights based on their good reviews. They were very responsive and Boz gave us a quick and accurate estimate. The work was scheduled within a few days and completed in one day. Boz and another electrician were excellent- they were able to creatively place the electrical inside our walls with minimal drywall repairs needed. They also installed a new outlet for us. We’ve been very pleased with their work and we passed the new electrical inspection. We very highly recommend.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pOelREQnNhbEV5V0ZORFYwWnhRWEpSVmxSS1NVRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOjNzTDBsalEyWFNDV0ZxQXJRVlRKSUE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Eric Meschke", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2023-03-09T19:31:46Z", review: "Highlights did a bunch of work on our house.  We had used them previously to do work in our condo (they were the best to install a couple of ceiling fans--previous review).  We moved to an older home and they have been out twice.  First to install and update a bunch of wiring and outlets.  The latest time, they came out to install a couple of outlets for a sump pump, but because the breaker box was small and outdated we ended up just upgrading to 200 amp service.  Not only were they able to get it scheduled within a week (big job), they also cleaned up a bunch of the wiring in the basement.  Boz (the main contact) is great--very helpful and a nice guy.  His crew was very professional and worked hard for two days.  The city inspector was just out to review the work for the permit, it was a quick inspection and passed with no issues.  I did get one other quote for comparison (from a place that a co-worker recommended) and their quote was within $100 of Highlights for the 200 amp upgrade.  Our experience is that Highlights does high quality work and their prices are reasonable.  We have recommended them to our friends who need electrical work.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURoM3ZlVHNnRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDh3veTsgE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "W S123", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2026-04-17T15:04:34Z", review: "Highlights moved our service and brought it up to code. The were prompt, professional, and worked a very long day to get the job done. Price was reasonable. I recommend", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT214V1RFWnlOVTVsVFhaTVV6QkRSRTluWjB4NGNsRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOmxWTEZyNU5lTXZMUzBDRE9nZ0x4clE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Mark Armendariz", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2025-07-28T17:29:19Z", review: "I have hired this company for smaller work around the house over the past couple years and they've always been punctual, helpful, and professional.  The work was always done quickly and correctly.  Recently I hired them to handle a larger job replacing conduit between my house and my garage, adding a subpanel to my garage, and adding new conduit for network cables and they went absolutely above and beyond.  They showed up exactly on time.  They explained exactly what they were going to do.  They did whatever was necessary to get the job done well - spending a solid DAY working on my house, dealing with strange issues (it's a very old house) expertly without complaint.  Every one of the workers on-site was professional and kind.  The install was clean.  They even ran the network conduit further than I'd initially asked right to the room I needed it in, saving me what probably would have been two days of work.  And then they cleaned up after themselves before they left.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xaT2JteFFNV2wwWm5WVGRHaHJXVmcxYWs1RE1XYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOlZObmxQMWl0ZnVTdGhrWVg1ak5DMWc%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Doug Ferguson", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2025-10-23T11:55:15Z", review: "We found a gem in Highlights Chicago! Knowing we had a major electrical job coming, we tested out the company with a smaller job first (replacing a couple outdoor outlets and installing two smart switches). The two workers sent by Highlights were quick, professional and knowledgeable. The work also was reasonably priced. So when it came time to address significant code violations in preparation for installing solar panels, we went with Highlights again. Boz came out quickly to get a handle on the work we needed done and helped expertly and smoothly guide the large project from start to finish. Excellent Highlights technicians moved and replaced our circuit board in our main house, grounded our electric to our water line, and installed a Level 2 EV charger in our garage (which entailed trenching and laying conduit through our back yard and adding a second circuit panel in the garage). All of this work was excellent and was permitted by the City without a hitch. We highly recommend Highlights for all of your electric needs, whether big or small!", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25Cak4zZFFkMTh6VEhKRFRWZHNZM0Z1Wlc5NldIYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOnBjN3dQd18zTHJDTVdsY3FuZW96WHc%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Ellaine Choi", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2024-02-29T01:38:12Z", review: "If you are looking for a professional and reliable electrician, i highly recommend Highlights Chicago. Boz, Cris and Victor are very professional and easy to work with. They come on time and finish installing 12 new lights in less than 8 hours! They went above and beyond my expectations. Plus their pricing is VERY reasonable compare to other electricians. I would call them again for future projects", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURkXzkycVB3EAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDd_92qPw%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Emily Maue", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2022-10-11T19:08:41Z", review: "Highlights Chicago was great! Super responsive, easy to receive a quote, and we’re able to do the job quickly and very well done. They installed a new light and also put in new electrical above my dining table. The technicians asked my opinion to make sure the light was hung to my preference and did an awesome job. Would definitely use this company for electrical needs again!", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURlZ1ltQjNBRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDegYmB3AE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Lena Farah", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2025-10-07T01:59:31Z", review: "Most professional and efficient team I've met. I need to thoroughly thank Jimmy and Davor as they were the best team, very experienced, and worked very quick! I was very lucky to book a same day appointment in the city of Chicago (which we know same day can be VERY rare), where they came in the expected timeframe given, were very polite (& took off their shoes) and truly focused on the work that needed to be done! Not only were they very detailed and thorough, they were kind enough to explain their work being done. Truly Jimmy and Davor are the best duo!! It was a pleasure meeting them!!  From talking to Anna on the phone (who was incredibly professional, clear in communication and polite) to meeting Jimmy and Davor - truly the BEST electricians in the city - I would 10/10 recommend.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xGaVVEaHJVak5GVGkxbFJEaEJYMDlxWkhKbFlVRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOlFiUDhrUjNFTi1lRDhBX09qZHJlYUE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Natalia Soroka", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2026-06-20T06:41:15Z", review: "Very happy with the service. Schedules quickly with Anna, the guys came and fixed everything fast. Will hire again.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21KcE4wcHpUM3B6YjNWblFVSjVkMTlxVDJFMllWRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOmJpN0pzT3pzb3VnQUJ5d19qT2E2YVE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Brian McConkey", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2025-11-10T15:56:43Z", review: "Highly recommend Highlights Chicago for any of your electrical needs.  They were very easy to work with. Boz, came by and gave a quote. Iva did all the scheduling. And Jimmy, Christobal and Davor did fabulous work.  Everyone was friendly and profesional. Can't say enough good things about the overall experience and the finished work. We are in a loft with high ceilings and they were installing large chandeliers, fans and pendant lights.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xkQmJHRjVUbGd0YzJzdGVVTjNhVTA0TW5ablQxRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOldBbGF5Tlgtc2steUN3aU04MnZnT1E%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Yi Wen", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2025-10-03T15:06:32Z", review: "Boz and his team are truly outstanding! They are very professional and use the latest and best equipment for EV charger installation. From measuring to wiring to the final setup, every step was done with great skill and attention to detail.  Another huge plus is that they can provide EVSP certification, which makes it easy for customers to apply for the ComEd rebate — something that saves both time and money.  Their customer service is excellent as well. They really listen to what the client wants, give professional suggestions, and keep smooth communication throughout the entire project.  I strongly recommend Boz and his team to anyone who needs an EV charger installed. No need to hesitate — they are the best choice!", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tSTUxXNXVXSGxIYUdWUExVOU1NSEZLTmpKU1gzYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOkRMLW5uWHlHaGVPLU9MMHFKNjJSX3c%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "John Le Moine", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2026-04-23T18:04:09Z", review: "Such a great experience on some exterior electrical work. I  would highly recommend Highlight Chicago! Totally professionals at a fair price, what more can you ask for!", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT201YVVHbGZSbGxETTFGSlJYRmZXa3h0ZVhOeFZFRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOm5aUGlfRllDM1FJRXFfWkxteXNxVEE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Bob Boone", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2025-10-13T16:04:17Z", review: "I had a very complicated project to put a new EV charger in a 200+ unit in River North.  Nobody had done it before, and it was challenging to create a new 208V line going from the 5th floor garage to my parking spot on the 3rd floor.  Especially, when the building is 100% concrete.  After getting proposals from 7 Electrical vendors (AMS, T&D, Sims & Sons, Skyline, John's, Highlights, AC/DC).  Highlights was the most responsive (answering calls, replying emails, site visits, providing insurance/license info) and the most reasonable price.  Boz and his crew of 4 people showed up, did a fantastic job with the wiring, 1 inch pipes, circuit cutoff switch, and installation of my Wallbox.  They showed up on time and gave me an accurate time of completion.  I was able to charge my car 5 minutes after they left.  Thanks Boz and team, and Anna for administrative things.  Will hire them again!", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xSWmVsOU9SRGgxTUd4bmJXdFVWSFF0YkVwVFRYYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOlRZel9ORDh1MGxnbWtUVHQtbEpTTXc%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Роман", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2025-09-09T17:58:34Z", review: "Highlights Chicago did an excellent job on our electrical project! The process was smooth from start to finish. Anna at the office was helpful and made scheduling easy, while BOZ, the project manager, showed great expertise and kept everything on track. They installed several outlets and dimmer switches that work perfectly. The team was professional, efficient, and the quality of work was top-notch. Highly recommend!", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT20xR2RtcFNYMWxUWVcxcmRtY3dTemhhZW5jMlYxRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOm1GdmpSX1lTYW1rdmcwSzhaenc2V1E%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Guido Lorenzoni", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2023-09-21T02:04:48Z", review: "I can confirm all the positive reviews here. They came twice, first to set up the connections, then the painter patched up the ceiling, then they came back to do the actual install. They were super nice, very careful in handling the lights and taking measures and all, and I am very happy with the results!", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNaNzZYSTZRRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICZ76XI6QE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Dylan Haria", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2023-12-29T04:05:32Z", review: "I spoke with Boz for the initial consult and not only was he kind and friendly, but also answered all of our questions and provided different quotes for a list of projects in our condo in LP. From this, we were able to prioritize our list by weighing the cost of each project individually - very helpful and honest.  The team lead for the installation was named Kaplan. He was outstanding! He was extremely polite, went out of his way to explain the process behind his work, made sure to involve us in every important decision, was thankful and personable, and genuinely cared about his craft and the end result of the project. I saw him lead a team of over 6 guys, and always remained professional as he guided the team through the entire process, from the actual math needed for the measurements to the final execution of attaching the chandelier (with 25-foot drop from the ceiling).  Before starting, he covered every surface in the living room and kitchen to avoid a mess of dust and drywall. During the installation, he was focused (and stressed the same caution to his team) on preventing the chandelier from getting scratched - even going as far as re-wrapping the entire thing in bubble wrap. The same goes for the extension rods - he continually reminded his team to be careful not to scratch the brass finish. On the final day, he helped us clean the kitchen counters, moped the floor, and took out all of the trash from the install.  Superb, excellent, outstanding and impressive.Thank you, Kaplan!!!", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUMxNXZPY0VnEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIC15vOcEg%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Melissa Le Nicol", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2021-01-19T14:12:01Z", review: `These guys are absolutely AWESOME!  Kemal took my initial request and was so attentive scheduling Raul and Jose to install several light fixtures in my Rogers Park condo.  They removed an old ceiling fan from my bedroom and replaced it with a new ceiling fan I purchased. They also installed a new fixture in my dining room and living room. The new fixtures were still in the boxes, so they put everything together too, saving me hours of frustration. The guys were so patient, showed up on time, put booties on their feet and wore their masks.  With the new fixtures, I decided to replace ugly wall sconces and contacted Kemal again and he sent someone over in 1 hour! This time Elvir arrived and once again, put booties on over his shoes and wore his mask. Elvir is super tall, 6'6" so he didn't even need a ladder! He carefully measured and made sure the sconces were even. Everything looks GREAT!  Highlights Chicago are the best!!!`, review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUN5LU9mN3FBRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICy-Of7qAE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "LD", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2021-11-11T19:22:09Z", review: "Boz and the team were punctual and professional from start to finish. Their came out to assess the job, gave me a fair proposal the same day , and scheduled the appointment the next day. They came spot on at 8:00 am as scheduled and finished the job within 3 hours.Outstanding work! I will use them again and recommend them to friends and family. Niki in the office is highly professional and responsive as well! Stop searching and hire Highlights Electrical!! You will not regret it.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNHNTZXUGFnEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICG56WPag%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Mary Rudeyko", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2025-07-21T23:50:01Z", review: "We recently hired Highlights Chicago Electrical, and the entire experience was excellent. Boz, the owner, was incredibly knowledgeable and made sure everything was done to the highest standard. Anna, the office manager, was so friendly and helpful with scheduling and communication. The team was professional, punctual, and efficient. My husband and I are very happy with the results. Highly recommend them for any electrical work – top-notch service from start to finish!", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21rek1YVTJXVWt4UTB3Mk5qbHNMVTlWUjJKVmNHYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOmkzMXU2WUkxQ0w2NjlsLU9VR2JVcGc%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "L Zang", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2025-11-10T15:42:12Z", review: "Highly recommend using Highlights Chicago for your electrical / lighting installation. They did a fabulous job and I cannot say enough good things about everyone that was working on the project. From start to finish, the consultation and quote with Boz, to the scheduling with Iva, to completing the work with Jimmy, Davor and Christobal, everyone was professional, friendly and the work speaks for itself.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZEN