en" }, { reviewer: "Yuwei Bao", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2021-09-01T03:00:12Z", review: "I learned about Highlights Chicago through online forums as they were a recommended installer for EV chargers.  I spoke with Boz and he provided a detailed explanation of how they were going to route the NEMA outlet from the basement, where my box was located, up to the garage. It was not easy as it needed to be routed through tight spaces and crawspace, but they were able to get it done.  The total job took about 3-4 hours, with Mladen and Kaplan as my techs. The two were very knowledgeable, friendly, and answered all my questions. When they were servicing the work, they laid tarp to ensure my basement did not get dirty. They brought cleaning spray and cleaned after themselves once the job was finished.  Should I move houses and need a new EV charging port, I will be going back to Highlights. Competitive prices + professionalism was huge in my experience.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUM2dk15TkVBEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIC6vMyNEA%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Anthony Chan", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2025-12-01T15:12:56Z", review: "Boz & the crew came out quick to give an affordable estimate. They were able to schedule a technician to come out shortly after to fix the issue. They were quick, affordable, and dependable. 5 stars.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xCMGExRTFUMVpsVkhSTk5XaFBSMDlDYkVWaWVGRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOlB0a1E1T1ZlVHRNNWhPR09CbEVieFE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Craig", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2025-12-09T15:12:10Z", review: "Highlight Chicago thank you for the great work! I spoke with the office on Thursday they came out Friday and started working on Monday! My office needed more lighting Ben and Gigi were on time, professional and did great work! Bravo Zulu 