gle.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VKcVluT0RYdHVqRDZnRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEJqYnODXtujD6gE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Hilal Tamrat", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2025-08-09T20:15:37Z", review: "Incredible Electricians! I would highly recommend their services. I found them via a quick google search and I am glad I went with them.  I hired them to replace my smoke and CO2 detectors throughout the house last month and they came in on time and finished the job in less than an hour. Jimmy came with his colleague and he even gave me tips on why my kitchen lights were flickering which I ended up getting fixed thanks to Jimmy's recommendations. They were both very professional, friendly and very knowledgeable.  And this month, I had another issue in the house Friday night, called them first thing Saturday morning and they came in shortly after to help me fix my issue. Very quick to respond and attentive towards their customers. Jimmy was the one to come again this time and was very kind, helpful and resolved my problem in less than 30 minutes. I truly appreciated his patience today and how he was not rushing to get to another job. He did not dismiss my concerns and stayed with me and found the issue and fixed it promptly whilst also keeping me in good spirits.  Their pricing is also very reasonable and I was very pleased considering the level of high quality service they provided.  I am very glad I found them. And BOZ, his associate, called me to make sure everything was taken care of to my liking and to call them if I need anything else. The level of professionalism and care was truly refreshing. I will recommend them to my friends and family and will definitely call on them again if I need an electrician.  Thank you Jimmy, BOZ and team!", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tSZmJtbFVRVU5rVW5kVVkzcEdYMmMxYTBWdFFrRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOkRfbmlUQUNkUndUY3pGX2c1a0VtQkE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Edward Garrett", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2025-08-14T22:22:19Z", review: "Highlights Chicago installed track lighting in our apartment yesterday morning. The electricians (Christian and Juve) arrived at the scheduled time, confirmed the work to be done and began the installation. Their work was done before noon.  After completing the installation, they explained the track lighting features and answered our questions. They were very professional and we are very pleased with the work done.  We would have no hesitation in recommending the company to others. In fact, later that day a friend visited our apartment, saw the track lighting and was very impressed.  EAG", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2toaFprOUVSek01ZVRWZlduaGZWRmRHVGkwMmJFRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOkhhZk9ERzM5eTVfWnhfVFdGTi02bEE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Erica Acosta", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2025-07-24T16:25:02Z", review: "We are so grateful to have found Highlights! First, Boz is great at giving recommendations and working to understand potentially complex scenarios. We have a very old building and the wiring is less than ideal so we’ve really appreciated the help.  Second, the crew that came out for our first project was incredible and then the second project we did was 4 full days of a lot of work and Kaplan and the guys crushed it. They kept us informed and dare I say got us excited about new electrical panels.  We tell everyone we love our electrician and I can’t see a world in which we don’t continue to use Highlights.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xvMlVWbDNXakl5VjFWSVVVcHViMVp3YkdkMVdsRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOlo2UVl3WjIyV1VIUUpub1ZwbGd1WlE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Jojo8", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2025-08-02T01:56:23Z", review: "Highlight Chicago Electrical did an amazing job upgrading the electrical system in my entire duplex property. Boz, the owner, truly goes above and beyond, his attention to detail is unmatched, and even the village inspector congratulated him for adding extra layers of protection. His team was professional, respectful, and courteous with my tenants throughout the project. I couldn’t be happier with the results and highly recommend Highlight Chicago Electrical to anyone looking for top-quality, reliable electrical work.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pocWVsVm1NVkZWUjNoUVFsaExORXhvVEhWWFlsRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOjhqelVmMVFVR3hQQlhLNExoTHVXYlE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "william drake", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2025-05-08T16:46:59Z", review: "I had a great experience with Highlights Chicago!  The job was to change out the electrical panel and add outlets in my kitchen.  They came as promised to provide an estimate, promptly delivered an estimate, and showed up on time, as promised to do the job.  The technicians were kind, friendly, respectful and super professional.  They left the job clean and in perfect order.  All at a very fair price.  Outstanding job!", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VPRDRvTW5BdmF5ZDFRRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEOD4oMnAvayd1QE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Emily Anastasiades", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2025-08-15T03:36:35Z", review: "My building had an issue with the electric connecting to the front gate, so the buzzer wasn’t working. Johan from Highlights Chicago came out with the team and they were awesome! Showed up right on time, worked hard from 8 AM to 6 PM, super professional, and got everything working perfectly.  Big thanks to Johan and to Niki for making the whole process easy from project to invoicing. Highly recommend these guys