com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNfM0xqOU53EAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIC_3Lj9Nw%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Joel Friedman", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2025-04-24T17:27:38Z", review: "I had a an EV Charger installed in my detached garage which required running new wiring from our electrical panel and trenching to the garage. Boz and his team were fantastic. He was prompt in returning call and emails. And the team was on time for the two days it took to complete the project. They also maintained a neat job site and cleaned up after the project. I couldn't be happier with the service and the pricing was more than fair. I will definitely use them again for other electrical work.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTURvdHB2MXd3RRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgMDotpv1wwE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Nancy Erlien", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2025-07-15T22:45:04Z", review: "I engaged Highlights to do a variety of projects.  Some simple and some complex.  Boz worked with me to figure out the best plan for all the changes I wanted to make.  Scheduling was a breeze.  Victor and his crew arrived ready to go.  The work was excellent.  In addition, they had a carpenter get involved for the custom lighting panel under the kitchen cabinets.  Very professional and friendly.  Really happy with them.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xWcmFUVjBYMGxVZERkak5IRmpVME53V0hSMloxRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOlVraTV0X0lUdDdjNHFjU0NwWHR2Z1E%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Logan Ebeling", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2025-09-22T17:13:41Z", review: "The Highlights Chicago team were fantastic from start to finish. Boz, the project manager, was very responsive, on time, and explained things in an easy to understand way. The crew that did the work, including Kaplan , Gerardo , Cristian and Matthew, were all very kind, respectful of our home, clean, and efficient. And their prices were very very fair! I would highly recommend Highlights.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21OSlNqUlFaVWc0ZDBRelQwSkxNRUV5UVV0dWFFRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOmNJSjRQZUg4d0QzT0JLMEEyQUtuaEE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Jackie Barge", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2025-09-13T12:35:59Z", review: "When half of the house lost electricity (1 phase) Highlights setup an appointment very quickly. Jimmy and Davo quickly found the problem in the panel and fixed it within a half hour. Jimmy was patient, explaining what had happened, answering my questions. I will definitely use Highlights for any future electrical needs and will recommend them to my family and friends.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tKeWIwSlZTa0p3U0ZkMU4yVlhjMlZtUjNVMFgwRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOkJyb0JVSkJwSFd1N2VXc2VmR3U0X0E%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Linda Masini", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2025-06-19T03:12:08Z", review: "I contacted Highlights based on their van being on our block.  I needed a new ceiling fan installed.  I checked ratings for Highlights on Better Business Bureau and they are rated A+. Our condo has old electrical connections which my husband realized as he took the old ceiling fan down.  The 2 workmen were able to install the ceiling fan using their knowledge of old electrical wiring and adapting the ceiling electrical connection to our new fan.  We appreciate their expertise and ability to install a new ceiling fan just in time!", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25sR1ZUZEtOblJyYjNKYU1rSTBkamhqYlRGWFRXYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOnlGVTdKNnRrb3JaMkI0djhjbTFXTWc%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Mar Fdz P", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2026-01-14T22:34:06Z", review: "We had issues with some lights at our duplex, and after a quick inquiry on their website, they sent the electricians, who took less than 2 hrs to solve a bunch of issues we had with a couple of burnt switches, changing dimmers, and fixing a light fixture that had been inoperable for the past couple of years.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25VdGFHcEJOSGx6WjJoRVJteFJMVmsxYWpKa1EwRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOnUtaGpBNHlzZ2hERmxRLVk1ajJkQ0E%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Ian R Tranberg", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2025-08-06T23:36:53Z", review: "Highly recommend Highlights Chicago! They were quick to respond and super flexible with scheduling. The two electricians who came out were professional, kept the workspace clean, and treated my home with care. They explained everything clearly and took the time to answer all my questions. I’ll definitely use Highlights Chicago again for future electrical work.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pCeU5XUjZjbmd4YmxKMU4xVXhWRXRHTFhaS01uYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOjByNWR6cngxblJ1N1UxVEtGLXZKMnc%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Sneh Sukhadia", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2025-07-02T21:23:46Z", review: "Absolutely incredible company to work with especially at the commercial level. The electricians that came in were incredibly knowledgeable and inspected all the problem areas very thoroughly. We had an issue with communication regarding the billing but Nikki and the rest of the administrative team handled it very professionally. I would give this team 10 out of 5 stars if it was possible, we will definitely be using them for all future electrical needs.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2taMFN6TnBhMUJsTW5