do project. The work list included a large variety of tasks such as adding a new outlet, new ceiling fans, stove outlet, new dimmers. Everything was done on time and everything was left very clean. I was also very impressed by the efficiency of the project management team in terms of getting me a quote and refining the quote as I kept changing my mind. Finally, every technician seemed very knowledgeable and able to make good decisions on the fly, and adapt to problems on the spot. I also appreciated that they were able to guide me on decisions that had functional and aesthetic implications. For example, on the spacing for the recessed lights I wanted their opinion since they must see so many more kitchens and hallways per month than I've ever seen in my life. So they gave their honest opinion on what would look good, and I'm very happy with the results.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURwcmFlQVRBEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDpraeATA%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Ralph Dela Cruz", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2024-12-01T16:33:53Z", review: "Johan is very professional. Even after the project was complete, he returned to fix a recessed LED light that lost its spring. Johan's team ascertained all permits are acquired when the situation necessitates.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURQeG9ydldBEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDPxorvWA%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Kevin Callis", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2025-11-11T18:09:30Z", review: "The team at Highlights Chicago is outstanding.  We have used them several times and appreciate the value of a local company.  Responses are faster than expected and the cost very fair.  We highly recommend!", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xjMlpWSkxRbk5wWjA5Sk5saFRZMFYyTURGU1FVRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOlc2ZVJLQnNpZ09JNlhTY0V2MDFSQUE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Carol-Anne Muncaster", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2024-07-18T21:45:34Z", review: "We had to have numerous projects done at the house we just bought, from fixing outlets, installing lights, creating new outlets, and even running Ethernet cables. All of these projects were done by Raul, and I can’t say enough good things about the jobs he did. He approached each job with professionalism, attention to detail, and care. He walked through each job with me, worked to minimize the amount of holes he would need to cut in the walls, and even stayed late to finish a job that didn’t quite go to plan due to the layout of my house. He was fantastic to work with, and I’ll continue to use him for any other job in the future. It was also very affordable!", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURybGZDQmR3EAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDrlfCBdw%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "C Tucker", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2024-08-14T00:26:26Z", review: "Boz and his entire team were totally professional and  very friendly. We had a lot of work done on an old condo building which is not easy to do. They went out of their way to solve issues that came up during the process. We updated the electric box to 220, install can lights, install electric for a recessed electric fireplace, and moved and installed many lights, pendants, and sconces. Highly recommend Highlights Chicago,  Boz and his team for any electric work you need done!", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUM3d3Vxci1RRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIC7wuqr-QE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "SKT", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2023-07-11T20:20:55Z", review: "Today I had 2 light fixtures installed by Ben and team. They were in and out within 25 minutes and very patient with me in deciding what light bulb I wanted to use in my new light fixtures. I filled out a free quote questionnaire online early Monday morning, and Kemal from Highlights was already in contact with me by 12 noon that day. After gathering a bit more information, I had an appointment for install the next day. Wow, that was quick and great service! The employees from Highlights are very professional, nice and deliver exceptional service. I will be using Highlights for any future electrical needs.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURKdEstSXR3RRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDJtK-ItwE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Brad Hicks", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2024-04-03T14:56:31Z", review: "Highly recommend Highlights Chicago and I look forward to working with them again. The process to get a quote and schedule the job was fast & easy, and came in at a fair price for the amount of work to install a new 240v outlet on a dedicated circuit.  Boz & team were transparent and responsive in their communication, efficient in their work, and delivered a clean work product- both in terms of the new outlet installation & the space itself.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNENzhqb0ZREAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICD78joFQ%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Linda Kagan", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2025-08-01T13:20:47Z", review: "Prompt repair service for a small job: replacing two exterior outlets located on garage with new ones and new bubble covers. Mile the electrician is knowledgeable and worked outside on a very hot and humid day with no complaints. Price was fair and reasonable. Highly recommend.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2s1Qk0ycHBWRzVyV1VWek4zUXpVRUUxYm5Kc1NGRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOk5BM2ppVG5rWUVzN3QzUEE1bnJsSFE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "William Yeack", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2025-01-19T13:30:46Z", review: "The two electricians that they sent over were extremely knowledgeable and professional.  I am a particularly difficult client to work for because I do a lot of electrical work myself - but they were able to help upgrade my service panel and connect a dozen new circuits in about a day and a half.  All of their work was extremely clean and well done.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNfeF9tMEtREAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIC_x_m0KQ%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "D S Reviews", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2025-11-10T19:01:50Z", review: "Juve and Martin are the best in the business! I wouldn't hire anyone besides them...they have been to the rescue for many projects over many days at our house and I cannot say enough good words about them -- professionally and personally!", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21KQ1kzRldOMFprUkVaUlIwMTNXSFpXWVRCSlExRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOmJCY3FWN0ZkREZRR013WHZWYTBJQ1E%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "John Sisson", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2022-02-15T17:11:39Z", review: "I'm so glad I found Highlights Chicago! I bought a house in 2021 that needed a new electrical panel installed. I met with Boz, and he understood exactly what needed to be done. Oscar and Gustavo did the work, which included adding an entirely new electrical service line. They did a very thorough job from start to finish. Since then, Highlights have helped with several additional electrical updates at my fixer-upper home. They respond quickly and I know I can count on them when something comes up that needs to be fixed asap. They are dependable, do high quality work, their prices are reasonable, and they are simply nice people to work with. If you are taking on a house rehab project, Highlights are exactly the people you need to have on your side!", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNXc0lpNlBBEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICWsIi6PA%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Brian Whitehouse", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2023-11-02T16:50:52Z", review: `Wonderful experience from beginning to end.  I had a bunch of small projects that I wanted to address after living the my house a couple of years.  From the initial call, to Boz coming out for the quote to the teams doing the work I was blown away with the promptness and friendliness as well as the care in which they took with my home.  The quality of work was fantastic and I was very surprised by the way they were able to run new outlets etc. with minimal damage to walls.  The pricing was quite fair for true electricians, in my opinion.  It's very nice (and frankly shocking these days) to find this level of quality and professionalism in a contractor.  I have found my "go to" for any electrical needs going forward!`, review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNGNjl6UGlnRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICF69zPigE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "David Ortega", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2023-12-16T14:36:00Z", review: "Highlights Chicago is the Best!!! I could not be happier!  Boz and his crew, Chris, Victor and David worked for four days on my project and that was quick. They fixed all the haywire haphazard electrical I'd run myself over the last 20 years. Such a relief.  We passed city inspection without any issues. The crew was clean, friendly and good natured. They are definitely worth every penny.  Best experience I've ever had with a contractor.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURWbS1iQTR3RRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDVm-bA4wE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "jennifer diprova", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2025-07-13T17:09:58Z", review: "Very happy with the service...from meeting and discussing options with Boz, to having my team Ben, Cristian, and Gig complete the work with efficiency and respect for my home, I was completely satisfied and love the new look!  This is the company to hire and I will surely use them for any future jobs!", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2psdFRXOWhUM1pyTXpjelJFaElWMmhLWjJsbWNFRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOjltTW9hT3ZrMzczREhIV2hKZ2lmcEE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Nina", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2025-11-18T19:31:01Z", review: "I received 5-star quality service from Raul and Caesar today. As usual, Highlights Chicago is the electric company I turn to for quality results. Only wish this company existed longer than sixteen years!", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21OS2VHUjVTSGgzVG5weVNWcHVlbmhzY2toTE1uYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOmNKeGR5SHh3TnpySVpuenhsckhLMnc%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Mireye Bond", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2024-10-25T16:25:28Z", review: "We recently had exterior and interior electrical work at my mom's home. The work involved removal of the old fuse electrical sevice  throughout, installation of new 100 amp service, outside meter ground, supplemental ground inside, new washer and dryer outlets, installation of new utility light fixture and required permit. Highlight Chicago representative Boz was very responsive after I reached out to obtain a proposal. Their pricing was competitive with others we received. We are very pleased with the professional work and effort that the Highlight Chicago team - Luis, Jerado and Kaplan provided. They were polite, communicative as the work progressed and showed up on time. The work was completed in one day.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURYa3FIcDZnRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDXkqHp6gE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Sara Zailskas Walsh", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2024-06-29T16:11:42Z", review: "I used Highlights to have a 220v line installed in my condo. The team did great work, and I was really impressed with the level of cleanup too. I felt comfortable having the technicians in my home. Will happily refer and use again.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURMcmNmYTlRRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDLrcfa9QE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Scott Billik", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2025-07-16T21:00:57Z", review: "This team was extremely professional quick and efficient.  They also took care of the house, had them adding an outlet above the kitchen cabinets. Both backsplash and counter top were taped and plasticed off before running a fishtape over them to get the wires above the cabinet.  10/10 would use again", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25nNU9Fb3hXVloxZDI5UmJtSllSMnBzTWs1ek1WRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOng5OEoxWVZ1d29RbmJYR2psMk5zMVE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "David Boze", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2024-08-17T03:10:08Z", review: "We had a great experience with Highlights. Boz was fantastic as he helped us put a plan together for fixing up the electric in our 100-year old home. His team of electricians and Niki were all great and answered all our questions. I'd definitely work with them again!", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUM3MlpmNU1nEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIC72Zf5Mg%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Marshall Taylor", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2020-07-21T16:50:46Z", review: "I searched Google for a licensed and insured Electrical contractor and read the reviews of Highlights Chicago and was very pleased with the entire experience. Highlights followed everything I would expect as a potential customer. * They gave a quick estimate and provided an email copy of the initial meeting * Communication with them was excellent through phone calls and emails. * They arrived on time and the employees knew what they were doing and how to treat my home with respect while they completed the job. * After completion of the work not only was a review of the warranties discussed by also guaranteed my satisfaction with the work. Most importantly Highlights was priced competitive and did not try to offer additional add on from the original estimate.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQ4dVpXYUlBEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgID8uZWaIA%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Greg Miller", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2024-04-05T17:11:01Z", review: "Boz and his team are great. I needed a new service line, upgraded main panel, and upgraded sub-panel in the garage. I got quotes from other companies and Highlights blew them out of the water on price and time to complete. I'm very satisfied with the work they did and would highly recommend Highlights for any electrical service you may need.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUREeFBTaW93RRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDDxPSiowE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Evie McQuiston", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2021-11-03T15:04:39Z", review: "Working with highlights was an absolute pleasure. They made the entire process very simple. Niki was wonderful and responsive in explaining to me the necessary work and getting me scheduled.  Once my electrician, Juve, came out, it was a very smooth process. He went above and beyond to explain the work he was doing, and was very considerate of where I wanted my light fixture to go. He was extremely knowledgeable and offered advice on other elements of my home regarding what options I had for different recessed lighting. He demonstrated the highest level of professionalism and respect.  While estimated higher, the invoice actually ended up being lower than the estimate, which was such a pleasant surprise! Cannot recommend these guys enough!", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNHLWJEdDF3RRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICG-bDt1wE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Miran Maksumic", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2025-04-03T01:38:38Z", review: "Božo and his team ran a new electrical line from my condo to my new AC outside.  The work was very neatly and professionally done in a timely manner, and was more than reasonably priced for the amount of work that had to be done.  Also, the fellas were just good guys.  I left them alone in my place without a second thought.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUNJaWJXYkRnEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgMCIibWbDg%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Jennifer Sisson", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2022-02-07T20:52:42Z", review: "I spoke with several electricians about my 1946 home, and I am so grateful that I chose Highlights! They upgraded my electrical service, replaced my panel, added appropriate grounding, rewired and replaced as much cloth wire as possible. The team of technicians worked so hard on my house, and they were extremely personable and helpful. They explained what they were doing, asked for my input, and were extremely diligent about fixing strange issues they came across. I appreciated that they billed based on time and materials (rather than a fixed price) because I knew if I asked for something extra they would charge me accordingly and not feel put out. I was so impressed with how well the team worked together and so grateful for the creativity and attention to detail they brought to problem solving. They treated me, my home, and each other with respect. I will definitely use Highlights again in the future and highly recommend them!", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURtbzQyS25BRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDmo42KnAE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Colin Kepner", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2023-05-23T00:55:45Z", review: "Boz came out next day, had a complete write up on our project ready on arrival. He had the entire project finished by the end of the following week. His team was courteous, respectful, and all expert. His team did everything we asked for and more. The work looks amazing, safe, and professional. The price was fair, and he was attentive to our concerns throughout the duration of the project. Will definitely use Highlights again, and recommend to anyone!", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUN4OWFHblJBEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICx9aGnRA%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Amanda Sevilla", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2021-05-13T18:55:21Z", review: "Very friendly and responsive customer service - Niki was great. They asked us to send pictures of our panel and the work area so they were able to give us a quote over the phone - very efficient. They scheduled the repair within a few days of the call. Electricians were on time, wore masks and answered all our questions.  The repair work was very quick, professional.  They took care to be neat with their work and the install, running the line out of sight in finished areas and exactly where we needed it.  Would recommend and will use for future projects.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURLaFlpazVBRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDKhYik5AE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Ellyn Andree", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2024-07-25T18:08:43Z", review: "Their whole team is the best! I had a few minor things that needed to be repaired quick and their crew was out next day and thorough. Niki at their office made sure the invoice was sent over right after service so I had record of it. Highly recommend them for repairs big or small!", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNieXEzdk1BEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICbyq3vMA%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Drew Wehrle", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2020-10-27T17:50:32Z", review: `We hired Highlights to install several new light fixtures in our home; after reaching out, we were able to secure an appointment for the next day. The technician arrived "masked-up" and right on schedule, and he made quick work of the project. Also was very reasonably priced, and the team was very professional at all touch points. Above all, we're quite pleased with the work; will be using Highlights again. Recommended!`, review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNpc3EzdGlnRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICisq3tigE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "James Sharp", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2024-04-01T18:03:19Z", review: "We reached out to Highlights to install a set of chandeliers and pendant lights. They were super responsive- sending someone out the next day for a walkthrough and quote. And when they came out, they were fast, communicated everything with me, and did an absolutely fantastic job. From initial reach out to finished job was only 2 days. Will absolutely use them again", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNEcTVyS0lBEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICDq5rKIA%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Agnes N", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2022-07-19T18:39:21Z", review: "I couldn't be happier with our results from Highlights.  Jimmy and Will did a great job handling our needs.  They were able to manage our old house's electrical quirks with skill.  They were very patient with our many questions, and were very honest and knowledgeable.  I initially contacted the company using the web form, but ended up calling after 48 hours.  Not sure if their office was very busy that week, but I am glad I called to follow up.  I will definitely contact them again for future electrical needs.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUN1eU5qd05BEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICuyNjwNA%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Dawn Braun", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2023-10-11T18:17:32Z", review: "Great company! I was kept in the loop from beginning to end by the friendly staff. The installers were very professional and thorough. We had a last minute request to quote a separate job, they stayed longer than they planned to look into our needs and followed up with a call only a couple of hours later. Will definitely use them again!!", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUM1bklqU1BnEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIC5nIjSPg%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Rich Moskal", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2022-04-29T20:27:28Z", review: "What a great experience. Admittedly, this was a small job (hanging a couple of pendant lights in our bath), but I've had less than positive experiences with other electricians in the past, so I was skeptical. But Highlight's exceeded expectations and lived up to their rave reviews. Provided a quick and reasonable estimate within hours. Kaplan showed up right on time, explained the issues with the existing fixtures and installed the new ones in a flash. Cordial, efficient and conscientious. Niki followed up the next day just to make sure all went well. The price was great (even less than the estimate). I really appreciate good customer service and these guys delivered.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUMycDdtTk5REAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIC2p7mNNQ%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Derek Jew", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2021-11-01T04:33:27Z", review: "I needed a dedicated circuit installed to supply power to the heated floors that were being installed in my bathroom the following week. Highlights worked around my schedule to provide a free on-site inspection with quote. Highlights' price was less than half the price that I was quoted by another electrician I had used twice before. I'm very happy with the work performed, and the electrician was willing to answer some electrical questions that weren't even related to the job.  Overall, I highly recommend this business and I will definitely use them for my future electrical work.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNHa2VTbzF3RRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICGkeSo1wE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Jeff Harris", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2024-03-11T21:21:29Z", review: "Updated!  They did a big project for me which is the review below, but I was in a pinch and needed something done last minute and Boz came through big. I can not speak highly enough about these guys!!!  They made multiple quick trips over hear and got it done to make sure my overall GC project was not delayed. They are the best.  They was outstanding, expertly installing 12 recessed lights and an EV charger with precision and efficiency. Their professionalism and attention to detail were evident in every step of the project, resulting in a flawless finish. The work was completed on schedule, and the space was left fairly clean and tidy. I highly recommend their services to anyone in need of a reliable and skilled electrician.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChRDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUM5Xzl4ZBAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIC9_9xd%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Sebastien D. Fortas", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2023-05-03T14:29:58Z", review: 'I had Highlights install an EV charger in my garage as well as wiring to power an electric water heater. Both jobs were proposed quickly, and completed in short order at a good price. Both jobs involved outdoor conduits, and they are unobtrusive (underground when possible) and well made. Everything "just worked" without fuss. Highly recommend.', review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURSODhmWXZBRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDR88fYvAE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Brion Wood", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2023-10-03T18:51:45Z", review: "I can't say enough about how much I appreciate Boz & the guys at Highlights Chicago for helping us through our electrical issues.  We bought our first home back over Memorial Day and immediately started to have flickering lights & temporary power outages. We had multiple different electricians out from Thumbtack or other services, but they all seemed content with doing superficial checks with little-to-no troubleshooting. We heard about Highlights from a friend and reached out and they were very responsive. In the first instance they came out, they did more checks and tests than all of our other electricians combined. They even ran out to Home Depot to get some anti-corrosion spray as a potential temporary fix, knowing that we needed to get access to the meter box to do further investigations.  After our power started failing again, they quickly came back out and were able to diagnose the problem in our meter box and started looking for replacement parts. Unfortunately, our box was outdated and virtually impossible to replace with any available equipment. They deferred any charges for this second visit until we were able to actually get the problem resolved. Due to supply chain issues, replacing the box was impossible, so they came out again, took everything apart, identified the pieces that were causing the poor connection, and worked on fixing the parts we had.  These guys are great. I cannot explain how many times I called Boz to talk through any updates on the supply front. Again, these guys are lifesavers!", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURacWF5b1NnEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDZqayoSg%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Ed Gubman", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2024-07-24T16:34:19Z", review: "Highlights was easy to book an appointment. They were efficient and professional. They did an excellent job of cleaning up. The electrician gave me some great advice on lighting. I’d use them again.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNidkptN21RRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICbvJm7mQE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "shahryar afshar", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2023-08-17T21:51:37Z", review: "It was a pleasure to work with Highlights. They turned around a quote super fast. It was great pricing considering there was a team of electricians.  Having a team made the work two days instead of two weeks.  We appreciated Boz's insight and creativity.  We wanted sconces in addition to our lights but he pointed out that they wouldn't clear our frames and there was enough light from the main sources. Thanks for the honesty", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURwblAzLXpnRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDpnP3-zgE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Peyton Hawkins", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2024-07-24T16:25:07Z", review: "Highlights Chicago saved the day! Our power went out late at night and they arrived promptly. The electrician was knowledgeable, quickly diagnosed the issues, and had our lights back on in no time. Highly recommend their emergency services!", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNidk9HX2JREAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICbvOG_bQ%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Neha Tannan", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2022-05-12T18:32:15Z", review: "Highlights did a wonderful job for me! I had an an issue where a wire inside my A/C condenser unit (on the roof) had malfunctioned and had shorted. The A/C repairman said I needed an electrician to come replace the whip and the disconnect electrical box.  Within 1 hour of my calling, Highlights was at my house and fixing my electrical. I live in a walk-up building where roof access is off the balcony via a ladder. They brought all of the necessary tools, equipment, and material to ensure the job could be finished that day. I had a lot of questions for them about when and why this occurred and they answered all of them. They made me comfortable throughout the repair. They were very professional and I cannot say enough about how easy and nice they made the entire process.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQydXF2dnZRRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgID2uqvvvQE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Bryan C", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2024-07-06T19:09:29Z", review: "Highlights Chicago added 2 outlets in 2 bathrooms near the toilets for bidets. Communication was prompt and responsive. The techs were on time and got the job done quickly. They were also patient and understanding re: my questions. They were mindful of keeping the work area tidy and cleaned up after the job as well. Really great experience!", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNybHNLWGNREAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICrlsKXcQ%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Francine Estevez", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2024-09-23T23:03:21Z", review: "I rarely give a review on businesses, but I truly wanted to express my gratitude for all the work you guys did for me on my home. You came into my home and from top to bottom you knew what was needed for my home to past inspection. Hightlight Chicago your workers are phenomenal and masters in what they do. Working with Ben and Juve was very educational and they was very patient with what I wanted, where I wanted it, and explaining or answering all my questions on how things work they was very thorough in doing their job.  Theses guys came in and wired my whole entire home and passed both rough inspection and final inspection. The City of Chicago knows how this company works and how perfect they are with detail was impressive. I have already recommended this company out to many and I have no reason to not use them for all my projects. My home was a 203k and they knew every code in the book. And my home is located in Chicago. They even installed all my electrical hardware for my 4 zone mini split. Again Juve and Ben you guys are great and your boss was always attentive . Let me not forget your secretary(Vesna) who answers the phone always very nice and helpful. She made sure my calls was returned back. Awesome customer service. It was a very peaceful experience with you even thought I had other bumps from other contractors you guys was always patient. Thank you Boz,  you are great and don’t, get too busy for the little people. My forever electrician company.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNudkphRmtBRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICnvJaFkAE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Jay Patel", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2024-04-13T13:51:44Z", review: "Highlights Chicago did a fantastic job with the projects I wanted them to accomplish. Scheduling an initial site survey/quote was seamless and Boz explained his plan of action for both projects while also considering how I wanted the work to be done.  Cris, Victor and Boz did a great job on the day of. They arrived early and finished both tasks wellll before their estimated time to completion. Additionally, Boz provided quotes that were very reasonable and more affordable compared to other companies in the surrounding area. Their work is very professional and I am going to continue to rely on them for all my electrical needs.  Work done: installation of new 240V EV charger and installation of new light fixture in our dining room.  I highly recommend Highlights Chicago if you are considering multiple companies.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUREd19TYy13RRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDDw_Sc-wE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Christopher Libbra", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2024-10-14T17:48:49Z", review: "Our HOA used Highlights Chicago to assess a blown fuse which knocked out common area power.  They were very communicative during scheduling process, precise on arrival time, and an overall pleasure to work with.  They found some shoddy wiring and resolved it quickly.  They even found time to assess and fix a light switch issue in our closet.  Highly recommend Highlights Chicago!", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNYa3FEUW5nRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICXkqDQngE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Joe Mallon", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2022-11-04T21:07:55Z", review: "Highlights Chicago Electrical Services was awesome.  It was by chance I found them and I'm glad I did.  I called them in the morning about our faulty smoke alarm system.  This was about 10:00AM.  They told me they could be out there by 2:00PM, THE SAME DAY!!!  Sure enough, the technician arrived right on time, and changed all four of our smoke alarms.  Best of all, they put in top-of-the-line smoke alarms, which is what we really needed.  Thanks, guys, you really got the job done.  You're the best!!!", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUMtbnJ1Rzd3RRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIC-nruG7wE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Ryan Friedman", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2023-06-28T18:10:43Z", review: "I would highly recommend Highlights Chicago for any of your electrical needs.  They have done 3 jobs for me, from upgrading my 100 AMP to 200 AMP box, to redoing all my rooms with new lighting fixtures, updating and rewiring various switches in our house, to the newest job adding new recessed lighting in our living room.  The crew that did the work  ( Cristobal, Victor and Jose ) are absolutely amazing, detailed and friendly.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNKb2VDVTRBRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICJoeCU4AE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "ash cox", rating: "1.0", iso_date: "2024-12-18T19:32:57Z", review: "Can’t speak to their actual services since I won’t have the chance to use them. I specifically told the woman that this was time sensitive and was informed that they’d likely have the estimate back immediately (“probably by end of day of scheduled estimate” she said). I have followed up a few times but it’s nearly been nearly 2 days and they still don’t have the estimate available which means I won’t be able to get my cabinet installed before new year. So thank you for failing to deliver in a timely manner.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUR2d3JERG5RRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDvwrDDnQE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Mike Verdoni", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2022-08-05T17:40:40Z", review: "I hired Highlights to install additional recessed lights as well as a new ceiling fan in my living room area.  Boz was quick to respond to the initial inquiry and incredibly responsive throughout.  He came out in person to provide the estimate and walked through in great detail exactly what they would be doing.  I also had a lot of questions and he always quick to respond.  Jose and Juve who did the work were amazing.  They took great care to ensure the furniture in my condo was protected as they were doing the work and worked quick but with an incredible amount of attention to detail.  I can't recommend Highlights Chicago and this team enough!", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUN1MDlmb2dRRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICu09fogQE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Jessica Remitz", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2020-06-12T15:13:43Z", review: "We had a wonderful experience with Kemal and the Highlights team! They were prompt, quick and did a phenomenal job taking down a fixture and re-installing a new one (from a local lighting company, Hangouts!). The team also wore masks throughout and were careful to clean and put plastic on everything to help prevent debris and keep everyone safe. I would absolutely recommend them for any related service.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURjem9UNUlREAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDczoT5IQ%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Jacob Gross", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2024-07-19T21:56:23Z", review: "Don't look anywhere else for lighting and electrical work; Highlights is the one you should hire.  As someone who hasnt gone through a major lighting upgrade, I was nervous at first, but from the moment I had my initial call with Boz, to the moment Gig, Victor and Christobal completed the work, it was an extremely smooth process. In fact, it all happened fairly fast too; from first call to completed work. I was very impressed. For context, I am in a 1BR condo, and had 3 sets of track lights replaced with a total of 19 recessed lights installed. It all took about 7.5 hours.  Boz and his team (even those in the office, such as Anna, helping to answer phonecalls with my many questions!) were fantastic. A+ service.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURyazd5aTF3RRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDrk7yi1wE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Maria M Acuna-Sanchez", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2019-08-28T18:06:50Z", review: "I had a great experience with Highlights! I needed the electrical done for a new pool. The first company I found, took 2 weeks just to give me a quote. Not to mention that the price was ridiculous! I contacted Boz and he came out that same day and provided an estimate the very next day. One week later the work was completed, just in time for the pool inspection. The team is friendly and very professional, definitely recommend them!!", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURVMmFlbzZBRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDU2aeo6AE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "John Cupkovic", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2023-07-31T15:34:12Z", review: "Highlights did an excellent job installing track lighting in our living room.  They were also very timely and showed excellent customer service.  We will definitely be using them again for our future electrical projects.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNwNHFxOVJBEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICp4qq9RA%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Anne Ross", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2021-11-02T20:48:40Z", review: "Highlights Chicago responded to my online inquiry for service within a few short hours, despite it being a Sunday. A technician was at our house and the dodgy outlet fixed within 24 hours of my initial request. Not only did they resolve the issue in a timely manner, they followed up with us later in the day to make sure we were happy with the work and had no follow up questions. Finally, the bill came in below the initial quote. This company clearly knows their work and has the professionalism and follow-through that customer dreams are made of. Highly recommend!", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNHNmJfWEFnEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICG6b_XAg%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Spencer Ferguson", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2023-03-06T19:25:11Z", review: "Highlights Chicago Electrical did a great job in a short time for me. The electrical panel at my house was old outdated and under powered. They pulled permits for the city and updated my power service as well as upgrading my electrical panels from 2 to a 3 panels. I highly recommend their services! Thank you again for all the hard work.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURoMm9xOTN3RRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDh2oq93wE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Deborah Broyles", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2021-10-13T01:24:36Z", review: "A special Thank you goes out to Kemal and the two electricans assigned for installing two light fixtures in my home. Charles and Jimmy were professional, prompt and very hard workers. It was evident that they take great pride in getting the job done and finishing the order as contracted. They worked together as a team and moved about with efficiency keeping me abreast to the task at hand. I was very pleased with the outcome of installation and their work ethics. I will highly recommend this company to others and continue to have them put additional fixtures up as needed.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQ2aDRXRmpRRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgID6h4WFjQE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Stefanie Kwasiborski", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2024-03-19T19:29:47Z", review: "The best of the best.  Love Boz and his team.  They have done all sorts of jobs for me over the years including an entire home rewire.  Most recently installed an EV charger for us and provided us all the info on getting it paid for through the ComEd rebate program.  Super fast and easy to work with...they are my go to electrical contractor in Chicago", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQ5emFTUF9RRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgID9zaSP_QE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Christopher Renton", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2025-11-17T18:12:20Z", review: "Great experience with Highlights. Fair pricing, easy scheduling, and rapid follow-up. The team was a pleasure to have in our home. Highly recommended.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21sWFYwOVJWbk5OTnpGbFJFVTRTRFp0YWtGV1dsRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOmlXV09RVnNNNzFlREU4SDZtakFWWlE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Nate Grabner", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2021-08-24T21:52:18Z", review: "I can't overstate how great Highlights was. I did a large electrical remodel of a 2 flat and had Highlights do a ton of work, including new electric service, dozens of new outlets, and partially rewiring the apartments. Not only did they come back with the best quote out of any electricians I spoke with, but they did great work. Johan was on time, professional, and generally went above and beyond. Despite my building being over 100 years old and the previous owner doing a lot of shoddy DIY electric work, Johan and team were able to get everything upgraded, safe, and up to code. Of all the contractors I have worked with, these guys are by far the best. I will definitely be using them again.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURhN2RhVDBBRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDa7daT0AE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Ryan Buttrey", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2023-03-14T16:01:53Z", review: "We hired Highlights to do a lot of work around our house. They were timely, courteous, and knowledgeable. Pricing was very fair and the guys who came to my house were extremely good at explaining what they doing/asking me for input for changes they had to make. Definitely not a “not my house, not my problem” approach which is extremely awesome. We will definitely use these guys again.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURoamNiZFZREAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDhjcbdVQ%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Nissa Burch", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2024-07-20T01:05:19Z", review: "After the recent bout of storms and tornadoes in the Chicagoland area, we needed our weather head replaced before power could be restored to our home. Not only were they able to get the work done, same day, the price was fair and customer service was great (thanks Anna!). We'll be using them again in the future for all our electrician needs.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURyMC1PV2RnEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDr0-OWdg%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Josh Cohen", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2024-09-19T13:38:58Z", review: "Used them to run a new 240v line to my basement, very professional & responsive, brought 3-4 people & completed the job quickly, left the workspace clean, and all at a fair price.  There's a reason they have hundreds of 5star reviews, would recommend and use them again.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURINF92ZDdRRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDH4_vd7QE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Christopher Daniels", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2025-01-07T17:39:53Z", review: "Installed electrical lines for a washer and dryer in my condo. Also asked them to look at my broken outlets in the kitchen. Excellent job, completed in one day and very reasonable price, would recommend.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURmOFptaDlnRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDf8Zmh9gE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Audrey Turner", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2024-08-22T16:22:03Z", review: "Highlight Chicago responded quickly to my request for services and sent Gig to my home to repair my ceiling fan. Gig repaired my fan very quickly and efficiently. And he did not suggest that I should go purchase a new ceiling fan. In addition Gig is very polite and respectful of you and your property. I  highly recommend Highlight Chicago to do your Electrical Services! And ask for Gig! Audrey T.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQ3d29LbVlBEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgID7woKmYA%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Seth Thomas", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2023-07-18T19:03:43Z", review: "Reached out via email to move a bathroom light fixture, had to cut the pipe and give a new electrical box. Got a response, sent a few images, got a rough quote, and scheduled a time for them to come and do work. They arrived on time, was very respectful of my home, covered my bathroom vanity with a cloth, and cleaned up any mess from cutting into my plaster walls. Work didn't take long and I thought it was a fair price, good communication, and I will absolutely return back. Thank you!", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURKa2ZuRXF3RRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDJkfnEqwE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Katie Aquino", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2020-11-19T17:09:22Z", review: 'We were very happy with our experience with Highlights.  From start to finish, they were responsive, easy to communicate with, clear, and flexible.  On the day of service Juve and Oscar went above and beyond.  They were kept us up to date on progress and were flexible and open to making things work for our old house that has some "creative" electrical configurations.  Ultimately, they completed everything on our list including fixing an outlet, reconfiguring three way switches, installing a new outlet, and installing a wired doorbell.  They even helped us figure out some of our unlabeled switches on our fuse box.    Both wore masks as a Covid precaution and used tarps where they were working so that our house was just as clean when they left.  Will definitely be calling Highlights with any electrical needs we have in the future.', review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNpNzgza293RRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICi783kowE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Christina Chammas", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2021-02-17T17:44:22Z", review: "Needed to add a dedicated circuit breaker and wiring for our new oven hood going into our 100+ year old kitchen reno. Boz was great to work with, very respectful and kind and his team did a great job- kept the drywall cuts and mess to a minimum. I could barely tell anything changed when they were done! Price was very reasonable. Plus everyone was masked up and kept their distance which I really appreciated! I would definitely work with them again.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUN5ejV6SFFnEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICyz5zHQg%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Ian Dickens", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2021-12-30T16:08:57Z", review: "I've used Highlights Chicago twice now, once for a ceiling fan installation, and again for some pendant lights—they were super responsive and were able to send out someone to help within 24hrs.  I had the same technician both times and he was speedy, knowledgeable, and in the case of the pendant lights ended up figuring out an install solution that saved us a ton of time and money: can't recommend Highlights enough.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNtd1lLZTZBRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICmwYKe6AE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Matthew Kasper", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2020-09-03T16:20:07Z", review: "Highlights Chicago Electrical Services provided a free estimate just a few days after contacting them. We then had them out the following week to install two pendants and recessed lighting. They did a fantastic job. We're really happy with their work.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNDeS1PcVZnEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICCy-OqVg%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Nicholas Caputi", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2020-08-31T15:09:08Z", review: "Really amazing crew.  We had them install a new sub-panel in our garage (to power my expanding wordshop).  They were about $1000 cheaper then the other two quotes we got and the quality of the work was awesome.  They scheduled the job for about a week after the quote was finalized and were done in a day.  They even rewired the current electric lines into the new subpanel even though that wasn't part of the original quote.   Highly recommended.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNDdFltd0lREAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICCtYmwIQ%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "sheilah garland-Olaniran", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2022-12-14T02:12:50Z", review: "As folks know finding reputable and reliable service can be very challenging.  I am so excited to have found Highlights Chicago Electrical Services. I needed under cabinet lighting and was a bit apprehensive about altering what I already had, which by the way, was outdated and a potential fire hazard.  I worked with Project Manager, Boz, to find just the right fixtures to make this upgrade. I cannot say enough about Boz's dedication and commitment to ensuring I had the best possible experience. He found fixtures we really liked, got them ordered and had them installed all in less than a week.  I have put them on speed dial in case I need any more electrical work done. You cannot go wrong working this amazing company.  Thanks Boz, for toughing it out with me and really hearing my concerns and apprehensions and making my kitchen in time for the holidays!  Sheilah Chicago", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNCZ0kyektnEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICBgI2zKg%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Bree Pendergast", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2021-04-09T15:50:35Z", review: "Highlights was great - they were extremely responsive and communicative in the scheduling process. initially told me it would take 3 hours to install self grounding outlets, a couple of GFCI outlets, and troubleshoot a light in our entry way, but they showed up on time and with a couple of technicians and got it done in under 1.5 hours. The payment process was just as easy (Nicky was great!) and overall definitely worth the very reasonable pricing.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNLOGNPX1ZnEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICK8cO_Vg%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Jane Roberts", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2020-11-24T23:04:33Z", review: "All of these 5 star reviews aren't wrong. I found Highlights via a google search as I was looking for an electrician to install a chandelier and dimmer switch. Seeing the great responses I gave them a call and am glad I did. I spoke with Kamal who was able to send someone out the next afternoon. Raul, the technician who came, was amazing. Showed up in a mask, took off his shoes (even though I didn't ask) and was super friendly, knowledgeable and efficient. I love my new light fixture, and am so happy 