 They do great work, quickly. They are communicative, helpful, punctual and affordable. Their employees are kind and personable and I never feel like I’m being taken advantage of. I would recommend their services to my friends and family, and they are the only electricians we will use in Chicago. Wish I could give them 6 stars.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNVeFB6cEJBEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICUxPzpBA%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Debra Farida", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2022-12-23T01:49:58Z", review: "Absolutely loved working with Kemal and Raul! Kemal was very easy to get in touch with and scheduled a visit asap to attend to my electrical needs. I had a water heater that kept tripping an outlet. Water heater repair people wanted to replace the heater. I held out and checked out the electrical first. Turned out to be the outlet. A much easier and cheaper fix. Would use these guys again in a heartbeat! Especially Raul. He was fast, super clean, wore a mask and booties at my request with no prob. Highly recommend.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNCMnVPcDBnRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICB2uOp0gE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Liz Shane", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2019-07-30T14:22:29Z", review: "We had a great experience with Highlights Chicago. The technician was very polite and knowledgable. We had some questions about some other things above and beyond our original service request and he offered to do the extra work on the spot for no additional cost (other than the parts he needed to purchase). After the work was complete, the company called and said that they had quoted us a bit more than what it actually cost (it took less time than they thought), so they charged us less than the quoted price. We will definitely use them again for future projects.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNVNWRlRUVnEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICU5deEEg%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Nathan Goldsmith (BitAnswers)", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2024-11-22T23:28:38Z", review: "Highlights did a great job running a 40amp line and hooking up my outdoor sauna. Juve and Martin did a great job prepping the work site and keeping everything clean. They even screwed back in all the drywall they had to cut", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNQMHFlOUhREAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICP0qe9HQ%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Ryan Christopher", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2020-10-04T20:32:38Z", review: "We worked with Boz to get a quote to install new light fixtures in our kitchen and dining room. They were quickly able to schedule a time and they completed the work in a timely manner. They cleaned up well and everything looks great. I would definitely recommend.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURDNWFERkxnEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDC5aDFLg%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Josh Klinger", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2025-06-04T18:25:18Z", review: "Victor replaced a breaker switch with speed and efficiency. The price is always on point and the professionalism is like no other. This is the only company you need stored in your phone for electrical work.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VOZmxtT0dBZ2JMNzhBRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKENflmOGAgbL78AE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "richard zimmeraman", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2024-07-27T20:04:30Z", review: "Highlights Chicago did an absolute phenomenal job and I could not be happier. I had an ev car charger installed.  There pricing was very fair and communication and willingness to accommodate my schedule was top notch. Call Boz, you won't be disappointed!", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNiZ2VQaE1nEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICbgePhMg%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Caite", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2021-08-19T02:12:05Z", review: "I would highly recommend the team at Highlights Chicago.  Mladen and Delvin were efficient and provided very high quality work. Before finding Highlights, we had attempted to work with another electrician to complete some work on our house, but experienced numerous delays and decided to look for another company. I found Highlights and decided to go with them based on the many positive reviews I read online. Not only did Highlights get us on their schedule much more quickly (Nicky arranged to have someone come out the same night I called, and Boz provided a proposal later that same night), but they also completed the work for a much more reasonable price than the previous company had quoted for us. We will definitely use them again for future projects!", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURhNnREbVNREAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDa6tDmSQ%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Jane Farias", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2021-07-24T12:44:10Z", review: "Highlights Chicago Electrical Services had done fantastic work for our condominium association in the past so when I personally needed work done, I hired them. They replaced a faulty GFCI outlet by my kitchen sink, removed an old audio volume control from the wall and installed a new chandelier. They asked questions appropriate for the work. (chandelier placement, chandelier height, etc.). They worked efficiently and cleaned up when their work was complete. I would definitely hire them for future work. Update - 27-Oct-2021- I had additional work to be done.  Again, the electrician that came out did a fantastic job.  They replaced a wired smoke detector with a combo smoke detector / carbon monoxide detector, capped off the original carbon monoxide detector, replaced 1 closet light, and replaced 2 exterior lights.  He worked swiftly and efficiently.  I will definitely use them again for my future electrical needs.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNhOU4ydHZBRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICa9N2tvAE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Engin Erdogan", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2022-02-03T18:48:36Z", review: "A special shout-out to the entire staff (especially Huseyin) for their outstanding work, professionalism, very useful and realistic recommendations, very reasonable quote and the most importantly, being on time and delivering perfectionist service. Keep up the good work guys!", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURtcGJTemVnEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDmpbSzeg%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Andrew OMalley", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2023-04-16T16:01:29Z", review: "I had the pleasure of using Highlights for two home improvement projects. Rolando and Cristian were great in updating my panel and installing all new wiring for a basement and kitchen remodel. They offered professional insight and I would highly recommend their services. Especially in updating old wiring.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURSeU1PWWJnEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDRyMOYbg%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "ksc5431", rating: "4.0", iso_date: "2023-08-01T19:46:45Z", review: "Highlights Chicago was the best price as well as the best rated for a local electrician, so I decided to hire them. The two workers that came to my home were quick to add the necessary wiring and breaker per my project. Unfortunately, they did forget to turn on the disconnect for a piece of equipment (located on the roof, ladder needed which I do not own). Luckily, my HVAC company was still onsite to help resolve the disconnect switch issue by having the necessary ladder to get on the roof.  I also had a minor issue as well with a hole in the wall as the workers thought there was a hidden junction box. (There was not). After speaking with Nikki, they were able to help me with the situation.  In summary, they got the job done with a great price and some minor hiccups. On the bright side, Nikki was able to help resolve these hiccups as quickly as possible and to make things right.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNwNnVPZmNnEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICp6uOfcg%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Nick Jacques", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2020-10-06T21:16:30Z", review: "Updated Oct 19, 2021: I used Highlights about a year ago to install a light fixture in my apartment, and everything went perfectly (please read my original review below)! Now a condo owner, I needed to have a ceiling light installed as well as have a new outlet added in my laundry closet.  Boz stopped by to perform the estimate, and he was very straightforward, providing both a plan A (which involved using existing conduit for the new outlet) and a plan B (running new conduit up to the ceiling and to the breaker box). The light installation was rather straightforward.  When the time came to move ahead with the project, I had a few challenges scheduling that I did not encounter previously. I chalked this up to the current high demand for tradespeople and also to a family emergency with my main contact at Highlights. Once scheduled, Boz returned with Ben and an assistant, who ran conduit for the light fixture and replaced the wall box to a 2-gang box. Ben was also able to use existing conduit to run the laundry outlet wiring, a big positive!  Highlights was willing to work with me on a second visit by Ben, since my light fixture did not arrive by the time of the first visit. Ben and an assistant came back out to install the fixture once it arrived, and did a great job.  I had a few minor quibbles this time around, with scheduling (as mentioned) and with the work. For example, the laundry outlet was to be put on a new breaker, but it was wired to an existing (but essentially unused) breaker instead. Functionally it all works the same, but there was a minor misunderstanding somewhere along the way.  All in all, I'm quite happy with the work and I'll use Highlights again in the future!  Original Oct 6, 2020: Simply put, my experience with Highlights Chicago was amazing! I initially contacted Kemal asking for a quote on installing a light fixture. After exchanging some texts and pictures of the room, Kemal provided me a quote that was in line with others I'd received.  I had several follow-up questions for Kemal, since I wanted to avoid opening up the drywall in the room if possible. Kemal sent an electrician, Raul, over at no charge to assess the install in person and put together a plan that would avoid cutting into the walls. Once I wanted to move ahead, Raul and an assistant were able to come out *the next morning* to install the fixture.  They draped and covered the entire room, and did a great job installing the conduit and fixture. Raul even consulted me several times during the installation to ensure the fixture was installed exactly the way I wanted it. They did a wonderfully thorough job and cleaned up the room very well once they finished!  I won't hesitate for a second to call up Highlights Chicago for any future electrical work - they've set an amazingly high standard for quality of work. I'd like to give a special shout-out to Kemal for fielding all of my questions, and to both Kemal and Raul for being so professional yet friendly. Thanks again!!", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURDemNPbWF3EAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDCzcOmaw%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Scott Smith", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2021-10-07T12:06:24Z", review: "Boz and his team provided excellent service, and I would highly recommend Highlights Chicago. Our work included service upgrade to 200 amps, and the project was completed on time. The team was very professional - friendly and courteous, and they kept a very clean worksite.  I really appreciated how responsive Boz was, and will definitely work with him and his team again if I have any electrical needs.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQ2emNDWlRnEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgID6zcCZTg%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Larisa Olson", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2024-10-24T19:58:18Z", review: "What a great business. They are so well-organized, fantastic customer service. All nice people. Technicians run to the store for you to get the proper bulbs. They never act like anything is a hassle. They are honest. Decent. Try to undercharge rather than overcharge. Total professionalism and great work ethic. Color me impressed! You now have a loyal customer.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURYakxMZGJBEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDXjLLdbA%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "OLIVIA CARTER", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2022-10-25T22:06:56Z", review: "I needed an electrician for an outlet in my basement because I had just purchased a washer and dryer.  Also, my garage needed complete new wiring after a replacement roof, and all the old  wiring was gone anyway.  I called Highlights Chicago and spoke with Boz, the electrical technician. He came by and analyzed what I needed done and sent me a proposal for both jobs the next day. The price was very reasonable for each but I wanted to start with the basement outlet first, then would decide on the garage afterwards. Needless to say, I was overly impressed with the professional work that was done.  So, I called them back right away to have them come back and completely wire up the garage. Boz showed up with Ben, William and Gerardo.  I work from home and let them know if they needed me they could call me at any time.  Well before I knew it they were done (they are fast as well as efficient) and asked for me to come and take a look at the finished work.  Oh my god, I was so happy and excited with the quality of work they did in my garage.  My garage lighting looks great and I'm totally satisfied.  I was blown away!  I now have a go to company for all my electrical needs. LOL.  It's very hard to find someone you can trust to come to your property and do what they say they're going to do and actually execute it.  But when you do happen to find a company that takes pride in their work, and do a really great job, you'll want to hang on to those companies such as Highlights Chicago. I would highly recommend them to everyone I know. because they do such excellent work.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUMteU1YUjB3RRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIC-yMXR0wE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Tom Lisnich", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2021-12-21T19:35:17Z", review: "Can I give more than 5 stars?  These guys are world class honestly.  Their bid for installing 3 EV chargers at our condo building was less than half than a few other bids we got.  Then the actual work? It honestly couldn't look and function better.  Boz and his team were so incredibly nice and so helpful....and they got a HUGE job done for us in a day.  I've never been happier with a hired job in my life - HIGHLY suggest using these guys for any project!", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNtdks2UEZBEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICmvK6PFA%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "J R", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2020-09-30T16:06:29Z", review: "Highlights Chicago did a great job overall. We had electrical boxes added in our ceiling to center a chandelier and addition of two kitchen pendants. We also had several cans installed in place of track lighting. The technicians Raul and Juve were very thoughtful and helped us plan out where to place our lighting for the best results. Our ceiling light fixtures were centered perfectly. They were very respectful and made sure that no mess was left after the job. Customer service by Kamal and Boz was also fantastic as they were friendly, prompt, and replied very quickly. Wwe were able to schedule service really fast as well. I would definitely recommend to others and will use in the future.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURDa2Zxb3ZnRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDCkfqovgE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Sara D", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2023-06-12T20:49:35Z", review: "I did a bunch of electric work with Highlights and am so glad I did! Boz came to look at the project, give advice, and create an estimate, and then Raul and Cesar did all installations. They were professional and went out of their way to help me (eg coordinating with painters in my apartment when I was out of town and helping me find the right warm color light for under my kitchen cabinets). Very, very grateful.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUR4dFpyRHB3RRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDxtZrDpwE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Ken Nishi", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2019-07-30T22:30:20Z", review: "Boz and his crew were outstanding.  I had three highly rated companies provide estimates.  Though the prices varied, I chose Highlights Chicago.  Highlights did quality work, no shortcuts.  All work done to code.  Work included new panel, as old panel had no open circuits and was overloaded.  Multiple GFCI outlets trouble shot with new ones installed in bathroom, kitchen, for sump pump, for washer / dryer.  Circuit for AC was corrected.  I highly recommend Highlights Chicago.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNVMWE3SUNBEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICU1a7ICA%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Joe Hardin", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2023-03-21T14:32:58Z", review: "Great experience with Highlights Chicago at our apartment in Chicago.  They were responsive on scheduling and their tech, Juve, that showed up was very considerate and respectful and totally competent.  He listened very closely to represent our concerns and offer the best guidance on an alternate solution.  He was very patient and knowledgeable.  Highlights will be first on our list the next time we need any repairs.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURoMzlhVVBBEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDh39aUPA%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Zach Sorrow", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2021-02-11T20:07:31Z", review: "I highly recommend Highlights. Needed a second opinion on some electrical repairs, and Baz was able to make it out for an estimate the next day (he would've come the same day if I'd been available!). Not only was he able to match the competitor's price, but he included a few small additional services on top, and was able to book me only 3 days later (again, would've been 2 if not for myself).  Raul and Jose showed up on time, in masks, and made an effort to keep as much of the snow outside as possible. Then they spent 2 hours outside installing a ground rod when it was only 5 degrees F. They cleaned up my electrical panel and installed a new circuit to replace a hazardous power strip in the basement left behind by the previous owner.  When they were finished, Jose took the time to mop up any slush from outside, which was very much appreciated. I'm very happy with the work they did.  These folks are great, I'd definitely return to Highlights in the future.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUN5azh1WVVREAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICyk8uYUQ%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Abby Peachey", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2022-04-25T16:03:59Z", review: "Very pleased with the services provided. They were able to get us in quickly, arrived on time, and quoted much lower than the other electrician we have used in the past. We had humidistats installed in our bathrooms and also outdoor lighting/outlets on our rooftop. Looks great and another plus is they had the light fixtures in stock so one less thing for me to order.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUMydWZmOVRBEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIC2uff9TA%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Ria Hirsch", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2021-12-16T19:55:14Z", review: 'These guys are incredible - great service, value, and unlike many contractors they take the time to really explain what they are doing, and why it is important. My partner and I recently purchased a 100 year old Chicago 2-flat that we thought needed a bit of work but, as it turns out, is one of those buildings where the previous owners thought they knew best and made slapdash DIY repairs/"upgrades" that are at best mediocre and at worst extremely dangerous. The Highlights team has already helped us bring the electric in the two flats up to code, disconnected the bonkers wiring in the basement in preparation for a demo and rebuild, and, when we realized the 8 ceiling fans throughout the building were disconnecting from the ceiling and hazardous to operate, came in and serviced and anchored all of the fans (apparently the previous owners had cut holes in the ceiling, connected the wiring, and called it a day). Then, when our demo team accidentally cut the power to our boiler furnace in January cold, they were able to get people out to us the day we called,  earlier than their estimated time by 40 minutes, and the heat back up immediately. Sometimes they are a bit slow to respond, so follow up is important, especially right now when COVID is running rampant and making people call out sick and isolate, but these guys are worth waiting for, and they will come through in a crunch. As we continue to repair and renovate our home, we will continue to call on these guys, and I will be recommending them to anyone in their service area. Thank you, Baz and team!', review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNteUptSzBnRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICmyJmK0gE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "kathy nolan", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2020-07-07T16:40:46Z", review: "Boz and crew from Highlights Chicago replaced lighting fixtures in four of our office restrooms and did an amazing job! What appeared to be a straightforward lighting removal and replacement instead became a bigger project taking more time than planned. The crew handled the readjustments professionally finishing up with a job well done. We highly recommend Highlights Chicago for your lighting needs!", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUM4M3JYN2lnRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIC83rX7igE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Steve Paluck", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2020-08-26T23:49:11Z", review: "I needed additional electrical outlets on my rooftop deck and the skilled electricians at highlights did an amazing job installing them. They arrived on time, wore masks and were friendly to work with. I now have five extra outlets to use in my outdoor space. I highly recommend them for your next electrical project!", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNDOGViV09BEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICC8ebWOA%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Kimberly Nelson", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2023-12-23T00:33:21Z", review: "There’s a reason why this company literally has a 99% 5-star rating. This past August, I was replacing an old ceiling fan in our daughter’s room. Because of the very old wiring we’ve had for years, we thought re-wiring was in order. Called many electricians. Some were too busy; most didn’t service our area; and even more didn’t respond. I saw Highlights Chicago’s website and called them. I was jaded and didn’t expect much. I got BOZ. He set up a slot for us PROMPTLY and came out to our home on time.  I told him that we possibly needed a possible full-rewire. (I know. Wrong move, right?) He could have taken advantage of that. But he didn’t. Instead, Boz educated me on the old wiring for what was needed right then, and instructed me on the ceiling fan. Which I installed myself. Thanks for the lesson, Boz. More recently, I was in a crunch. Needed wiring for a big job coming up the first week of the year. Texted Boz this past Tuesday. He responded Tuesday afternoon. Sent Ben out Wednesday morning. And now, I’m good to go for our upcoming project!  Ben did great work. Was straight business. Courteous. Great clean-up. BEAUTIFUL work, Ben. I asked Ben what was it like working for Highlights/Boz. It’s VERY refreshing and encouraging to hear associates speak well of their boss and company. Says much about them both. Did I mention that the price was right!?  And when paying the invoice, Kemal took care to inquire of my satisfaction of the work and made certain that I had all contacts needed for upcoming future services. I have NO PROBLEM RECOMMENDING HIGHLIGHTS CHICAGO to my family and friends. Which speaks volumes. Oh. And again. Did I mention…..THE PRICE WAS RIGHT!  AND THE WORK WAS EVEN BETTER! Exceptional, guys!  Thanks again.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUMxeEl1Y093EAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIC1xIucOw%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Jessica A", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2021-10-11T21:41:40Z", review: "We had Highlights Chicago out to install some fixtures in a new home. They were prompt to respond, easy to schedule with, and did great work. I thought pricing was fair considering the amount of time needed to install. Would absolutely use them again.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQ2Ni1LMmRnEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgID66-K2dg%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Van Nguyen", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2021-12-16T18:55:41Z", review: "I was in search of an electrician to work on my bungalow. The team put in new exterior outlets, split up two lights that were wired serially to the same switch, while replacing old cloth wire with updated wiring, and installed a dimmer switch for me.  I found these guys on Google just looking for local electricians in the area. Their reviews were good and their estimate was very competitive. Additionally, they were very responsive in coming out to look at the job, and were conservative about their options to tackle some of the trickier aspects of the job.  The end result is great so far. I will have to do some repair myself on the drywall removal for the new outlets, but they communicated this clearly going ahead of time.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNteUtiSzRRRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICmyKbK4QE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Kunal Lodhia", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2021-12-28T18:38:02Z", review: "The staff was very knowledgeable about the instigation process and they made sure that we were completely satisfied with the installation and work before they left.  They even came back to troubleshoot and help with something as well.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNtenB6UGZnEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICmzpzPfg%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Vero Smith", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2021-10-21T17:30:51Z", review: "Highlights is fantastic. Everyone that worked with me was super efficient, pleasant, and professional. They installed several fixtures exactly at the price quoted and did great work, taking extra care to clean the work site. They even offered to help me carry the old fixtures to the dumpster! Thanks so much!", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNHdE42Zml3RRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICGtN6fiwE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Pascal Berthoumieux", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2023-08-27T20:41:19Z", review: "What a great experience, I called them for a small job (EV charging station) They were 1/2 the price of others and based on their user rating, I knew I didn’t have to worry. . They went beyond the spectrum of work. Scheduling was faster than a good delivery too! I will recommend them to anyone looking for a great electrician !", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURwZzhHdnF3RRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDpg8GvqwE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Wayne Rassner", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2023-03-18T03:15:55Z", review: "We have used Highlights Chicago multiple times now and at multiple locations. This is one of the finest run businesses in the Chicago area. Boz and his team are always on time, always responsive and always answer all questions. Their work is impeccable. They have the most wonderful attitude even while they are doing the actual work. They explain everything and keep the work area immaculate. Everyone on the team is kind and considerate. We actually look forward to electrical projects because we know they will be done perfectly and with exceptionally friendly service. Thank you Boz and team. You all are the best! See you next project.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURocTZXWkZREAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDhq6WZFQ%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Keith Gorman", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2024-01-25T04:18:15Z", review: "Highlights quickly came and inspected my panel and discovered it needed replacement. The next day, right on time, in an ice storm the team arrived and got to work. They were so professional and kind and also noticed some other concerns. They explained all the work they did and the why it needed to be done and stayed extra to complete the larger scope of work. Truly wonderful people.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURObllYVG9RRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDNnYXToQE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Caroline Robbins", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2021-01-21T01:18:25Z", review: "My electrician from Highlights showed up 31 minutes after I called them and was nothing but professional and friendly! He wore a mask and booties the whole time so it felt very COVID safe.  He was quick to diagnosis the problem with my smart switches and come up with a solution and even went above and beyond to recommend to me the brand of switch he prefers and showed me the exact Amazon page to purchase from.  All around good experience and I will definitely call on them again!", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUN5MU83Q1dREAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICy1O7CWQ%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Amos Kwon", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2022-11-16T16:20:33Z", review: `It's too bad I can't give Highlights ten stars for the work they did for us. They are just that good. I asked Boz to come in and quote a bunch of work for our kitchen, bathroom, and electrical panel that were left unfinished by our irresponsible contractor for our home renovation. Boz gave us a very reasonable quote to essentially "fix a bad haircut". It involved fixing numerous outlets and switches, missing breakers, lighting, as well as new outlets and circuits. I was skeptical that it could be done in one day. Boz assessed the situation perfectly and pointed out things that I did not even know had been done negligently by the previous contractor.  I had been told by other electricians that they couldn't come in for a month. Boz sent in three of his electricians in the same week in which I signed the quote. Juve and Jose were two of the names I remember, but all three men were kind, clean, professional, and unbelievably thorough. They communicated everything to me and even gave me advice on which appliances to plug in where (who knew a four-slice toaster draws more power than a microwave oven on full throttle?). When they had questions, they didn't just ask me, but they also gave me my options and recommendations. When I didn't have an answer, they made the best decision possible and it worked.  They even did work that I didn't think of in order to do a complete job for the kitchen. They didn't add a single additional charge for any extra work they did... they did what they thought should be done in order to do the job right and completely. This is unheard of these days...anywhere. They worked relentlessly all day and only broke for lunch for an hour. They arrived at 7 am and worked until 5:30. Before they started, they protected all kitchen surfaces where they worked. Before they left, they cleaned up EVERYTHING. I have worked with many contractors in my commercial real estate job and in my home, and I have never met a group of tradesmen who were THIS good, this thorough, and this courteous. My only regret is that we didn't have them as our electricians for our renovation from the start. I cannot say enough good things about Highlights, Boz, and the staff. Remarkable.`, review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUMtal9fT1FREAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIC-j__OQQ%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "dane hites", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2023-04-07T16:54:41Z", review: "They were really great to work with; they were happy on site, flexible with my building's requirements, and did a good job. They set up plastic covering for all of the areas they were working, ensuring that it was a clean worksite, and finished the work more quickly than I would have thought possible. I'm very pleased and look forward to working with them in the future on other projects.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNSamJ6b0VBEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICRjbzoEA%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Elvia Torres", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2020-02-26T20:31:19Z", review: "After checking the BBB website, I reached out to Highlights.  The response was quick and we are very happy with our new bathroom fans,  light in the shower and split switch for a ceiling fan and light. The project was completed in one day!! The workers are professional and cleaned up the area nicely. We will definitely reach out to Highlights for any future projects. Thank you Highlights for a great job!!", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURzdlBqLVFREAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDsvPj-QQ%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Divya Thathu", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2022-11-28T18:09:30Z", review: "I received Kemal and teams reference from my realtor. Kemal was able to get his team on site the same day and get the wiring issue resolved within 2 hours of me reaching out to them! They took care of all paperwork and management reviews. They also left the place very clean and took care of the debris. This was the most smoothest experience I’ve had with any contractor this year and could not recommend them enough! I will definitely be reaching out to Kemal for future electrical tasks", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQtNW9UWDhnRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgID-5oTX8gE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Darryl Schroth", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2020-04-09T15:55:57Z", review: "I run a service department taking care of 250+ retail pet stores across the country and have been working with Highlights for approximately 2 years. Their service and communication is incredible. Their technicians are extremely professional and are always on time. Kemal is amazing to work with and is always on top of everything whether its a standard service or emergency. I cannot say enough about them. I would HIGHLY recommend them to anyone!", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNjeV9malhREAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICcy_fjXQ%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Mary Pence", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2022-07-10T22:15:54Z", review: `As both a homeowner and long-time landlord, I am very skeptical about all contractors. I found Highlights Chicago Electrical Services on Yelp, and was even more skeptical regarding well over 200 five-star reviews. I needed a major electrical service upgrade done on a historic landmark apartment building I own so I had no choice but to do the research and select a contractor.  I know there are ways to get great reviews on Yelp. However, nine times out of ten, those people or "services" won't bother to write reviews in great detail, let alone many paragraphs in length. As I read through the reviews I realized they were legit.  I can now add mine to the list. This company has truly earned every five-star review it has received. I have NEVER had such a positive experience with an electrical contractor. Quite the opposite. I got 3 different estimates, and they weren't the lowest, and not the highest either. Boz came out to look at what needed to be done (which included undoing the disaster the previous electrician created) within a few hours of my call. He explained everything in detail, and the pro's and con's of what my options were.  They never asked for any payment upfront. The estimate was extraordinarily detailed. Shock number one. The team I was assigned, Kaplan and Jose, showed up ready to go at 7 am the next day! Shock number two. They worked their butts off until well after 6 pm! Shock number 3. They came back the next two days and did it again. Shock number 4.  This is a company that is proud of what they do. The end result looked like a work of art! The conduit was perfectly aligned, evenly spaced and so symmetrical I couldn't get over it. Every detail was addressed, and all done without cutting corners, dodging building codes, or overcharging. Old houses are not easy to work on and require a lot of patience and genuine expertise. They worked around all the challenges and knocked it out of the ballpark.  As long as they are in business, I will NEVER use anyone else. The few hundred dollars you might save going with the lowest cost option is nothing compared to the misery you will spare yourself by having this company do the work. If I could give them more stars I would. They are also really nice people to work with. When was the last time you thought that about a contractor?`, review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURPdGU3dkJ3EAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDOte7vBw%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Roberto Lama", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2020-03-19T03:14:05Z", review: "The service they provide is outstanding. I called Sunday morning expecting to leave a message but I got to speak with one of the electricians. They came to my house two days after and did a great job getting 220 power for a new oven I needed installed all the way from the basement to the kitchen. They were very careful, cleaned up after and the fees where very reasonable. I would recommend them for any electrical work, residential or commercial.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNjOWRhZlVBEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICc9dafUA%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Leo Olivo", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2021-11-09T18:12:46Z", review: "The company was very responsive. Their electrician, Ben, arrived on time and installed five light fixtures very quickly. Ben also inspected the panel and fixed some issues he found. When he left, the took all the used fixtures and left the place pristine. Overall, great company to work with and their professionals are great. Will call them again if I ever need an electrician.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNHcTczSGV3EAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICGq73Hew%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Leija A.", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2023-08-01T19:58:39Z", review: "Y'all I cannot even begin to tell you how fast these folks responded! They have helped us with a specific light fixture twice now, once last December and once this past week and both times were extremely quick with their response and making us a next day appointment. We were very surprised by this, and were grateful that the folks on the phone were so helpful. Kemal and Nicky spoke with us on the phone and were so sweet! Unfortunately, I cannot remember the guys who came in to help us install anything but they were very thorough with their explanations and we've had no problems with the light so far lol. Glad to have such reliable folks to help us! :)", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNwNnV1ZlJ3EAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICp6uufRw%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Emily Edwards", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2020-10-20T19:05:20Z", review: "We were working with many different companies that promised quick timelines for the work, but Kemal with Highlights Chicago Electrical Services not only was the only company that followed through, but he was so professional and warm along the way.  We had a terrible experience with three other companies who promised to get the work done before and just never called to schedule.  Highly recommend this company and will be using them for all services in Chicago moving forward!", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNpMkttd3h3RRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICi2KmwxwE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Gary Marshall", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2022-02-01T21:11:58Z", review: "We are new to Chicago and our daughter and son-in-law recommended Highlights Chicago to us. The job entailed repairs, 3 outlets and the smoke alarm didn’t work, and installation of new light fixture. Gedas was fantastic. He fixed everything, replacing the GFCI outlets and the smoke alarm and installing both light fixtures.  He worked quickly and efficiently and made sure to clean up when he was finished. He also answered several questions I had regarding other electrical issues. The bill was very reasonable and we will surely use Highlights Chicago for our next time.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURtcWNtaGlBRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDmqcmhiAE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Brenda D", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2023-07-26T22:26:31Z", review: "Highlights Chicago is my go to company for any electrical needs I have, large or small. Raul who I've worked with twice is outstanding. They've installed recessed lighting in my vintage home, hung several lighting fixtures for me, installed dimmer switches where needed, and split off the electric sources to the garden fountain and outdoor lights so they can be activated separate. I highly recommend you call Highlights Chicago when the need arises.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNwa1AyVlpnEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICpkP2VZg%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Jennifer Leung", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2022-06-17T22:47:03Z", review: "Excellent service – had a short circuit and they were able to come within a few hours and found / fixed the issue right away. I called around and other companies who did not have as many electricians available (so were not able to come right away) even recommended them and vouched for their trustworthiness and the quality of their work. They were upfront about their pricing and the final bill was fair/correct and not surprising at all.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNPZzRMRXRBRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICOg4LEtAE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Mel Z", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2021-09-14T19:56:41Z", review: "The property management company I work for has used Highlights for a number of electrical maintenance requests lately. They've done everything from replacing bad outlets to replacing bad lighting fixtures or upgrading them. Kemal in particular is always cheery, bright, and professional! I know when I ask Highlights to fix something, it'll be fixed correctly and completely the first time. I have zero worries about discovering awful repair job hacks years later causing issues for my tenants. I will be happy to continue to recommend Kemal and Highlights to my other industry professionals.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUM2cDllS2ZREAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIC6p9eKfQ%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Rex Li", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2021-05-07T17:32:13Z", review: "I needed help installing 3 washer/dryer outlets. Boz and his team arrived on time, worked very fast (finished the work in half a day), and made sure to patch up most of the holes they made and clean up after themselves. I was very impressed by the work they did and definitely recommend them.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURLcXFlTGVREAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDKqqeLeQ%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Erik Shell", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2023-09-01T21:44:26Z", review: "The crew at Highlights consistently goes above and beyond. They've done so much work after we bought our first house to get things up to snuff, and every time a barrier has come up or something ended up being more complicated they've gone the extra mile to problem solve, fix the issue, and communicated with me the whole time. Great team, great company!", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNad0pPUTh3RRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICZwJOQ8wE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Audrey Young", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2018-07-10T21:17:22Z", review: "I called Boz in the morning to have an issue with our electrical panel checked out, which was found in a home inspection and everyone at the company was extremely friendly and accommodating. I was referred here by the owner of Skyline Electric, since they couldn’t fit us in.  We were hoping to get this issue addressed ASAP and Boz assured me they would get someone out between 12-2. I got a text message with a better time frame and the technician was even early! Mike showed up and he was friendly, compassionate and very knowledgeable. He is just a great person all around. He was able to quickly figure out the issue, fix it on the spot and had the upmost professionalism. He cleaned everything up and wouldn't accept my help.  I received an email soon after of a detailed account of what was completed to ensure to our buyers the problem was properly taken care of and everything was safe.  I would recommend Highlight Chicago and especially Mike for any work that needs to be done at all. I was incredibly impressed with the professionalism and friendliness I encountered.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUN3NV9xM01BEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICw5_q3MA%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Jaarmyia Williams", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2020-08-22T02:07:07Z", review: "I called Highlights today and they were able to provide service within 30 minutes. While I appreciated their speediness, what I really appreciated was how the technician, Ben, took the time to not only diagnose the problem but explain it to me so that I understood and gave me tips for circumventing this problem in the future. Ben was knowledgeable, focused, and All around pleasant and respectful of my home. And he took all the precautions to ensure my safety and his own", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNDOXVTc1dREAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICC9uSsWQ%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Staci Cash", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2026-03-25T10:14:55Z", review: "I have hired this company many many times at this point and they are ALWAYS on time. You have no idea how much that means to me.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT214TFJXMDVkbWRDZUVkNFZVSkdiVFkzWnpCR2IxRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOmxLRW05dmdCeEd4VUJGbTY3ZzBGb1E%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Cedric Meyer", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2019-11-11T22:15:42Z", review: "After looking for an electrician for several months and having a few unreliable experiences I was thrilled to find Highlights Chicago. Boz answered my initial call, was very polite and helpful. The final price was as quoted and very reasonable. Scheduling was very easy and there was no need to confirm severals times beforehand, the team showed up on time at the scheduled day. Cristobal and Martin were the two electricians that came to do the work. They were very polite and did an excellent and clean job. I would recommend Boz and his team to anyone who needs an electrician.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQwLWVDcTJRRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgID0-eCq2QE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "L C", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2021-07-23T16:57:08Z", review: "Highlights as a whole wonderful. Ben and partner did a great job of upgrading my electrical panel. Also installed multiple ceiling fans, upgraded outlets and removed old wiring. Big job but they did an amazing job. Neat too. Thanks again Ben and team!!!", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNhdU5mN3BRRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICauNf7pQE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Thomas Hayes", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2021-03-11T05:19:39Z", review: "I've never actually written a Yelp review, but had to based on the above and beyond service from Boz, Kemal, Jimmy and the team. They did a great and thorough job on running a dedicated home run line for in-unit laundry in my vintage condo. During this project they ran a junction box for a ceiling light in my living room. I had an issue installing the light. I called Kemal who conferenced in Jimmy to literally talk me through how to finish my self install. This project was not easy, involved cutting into existing walls to run conduit and figuring things out along the way. If they can provide this level of service for me, I am confident they can handle anything! Thanks, Team!", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUR5c1o3WUdnEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDysZ7YGg%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Leticia Magdaleno", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2021-11-12T23:14:29Z", review: "Highlights Chicago exceeded my expectations from the very begining. They responded to my initial query within hours, scheduled a time for Boz, the project mgr come see the scope of work and forwarded their proposal within the timeline they said they would. Boz then answered all my questions and put me on his schedule. The crew, Mile and Gig, came out on the day work was scheduled to begin. Boz took the time to introduce them to me. Mile and Gig were fantastic all the way around. Their expertise was obvious. They installed exterior sconce lights, outlets and switches. They were careful in the cuts they had to make and took the time to clean up after themselves. All debris was disposed of appropriately and their attention to the detail of their work was impeccable. I will for sure be using Hightlights Chicago for all of my electrical needs. If you don't want to be disappointed in a quality work product at very competitive prices, call Hightlights Chicago.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNHal9XYS13RRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICGj_Wa-wE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Keith Felker", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2020-07-22T16:59:51Z", review: "Highlights was an absolute pleasure to work with!  They were professional, friendly, informative, responsive, on time, and Elvir and Amin did an amazing job replacing the main electrical panel in our house.  I will surely call back on them if I need electrical work done, and you should to!", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQ4cGVMSG9nRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgID8peLHogE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Molly Pfisterer", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2022-07-14T21:24:29Z", review: "Boz and his team (Rahul, Kemal, etc). were so fantastic to work with!  The whole team was so nice, professional, and efficient.  They hardwired and installed light fixtures for us and we could not be happier - HIGHLY HIGHLY recommend if you want quality work done by kind professionals!!!", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURPMjZLVUFnEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDO26KUAg%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "OLisa Scott", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2018-12-13T21:49:33Z", review: "I was referred to Highlights. Ben came out, on time and diagnosed the problem with-in 10 minutes. I left to take my kids to school at 8:25. When I returned at 8:45, he was already done. These guys are great at what they do. Their prices are VERY REASONABLE. I won't trust another company with electrical work or repairs around my home but them. You most definitely have a customer for life. Keep up the great work guys.  Lisa", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNJN19McmN3EAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICI7_Lrcw%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Christopher Rizzotti", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2019-10-24T16:36:42Z", review: "This team has been absolutely amazing. I have used them many times they are professional,efficient, very knowledgeable of their trade, and my favorite great pricing. I would like to personally thank the hard work that Vesna, Niki, and Kemal put in on all the jobs that  have been done for me. Thanks for being amazing and I look forward to continuing using Highlights Chicago Electrical  for all my electrical needs.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQwMU8tS0dREAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgID01O-KGQ%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Michal Kokoszka", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2021-02-15T20:02:11Z", review: "Highlights Chicago was extremely responsive and helpful. They provided a free estimate and followed up in a timely fashion. They installed the outlets we requested as well as added a wired motion sensor light to the building. They were extremely efficient and quick! Highly Recommend!", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUN5cDZIcWZREAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICyp6HqfQ%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Alex Starace", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2022-02-14T19:31:39Z", review: "Very friendly, professional and easy to work with. Had them assemble and install 6 different light fixtures, 4 indoors, 2 outdoors. Turned out great, looks really good. Highly recommend!", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNXd1BQcldnEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICWwPPrWg%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Jorge Perez", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2021-05-20T05:31:56Z", review: "Great service all around. Getting the approval from the homeowners association can be challenging but the people at Highlights Chicago helped me throughout the whole process. Kemal and Niki helped me with paperwork and coordination and the project manager, Boz, met directly with the HOA to explain the work and get final approval. The work was done quickly and correctly. Highly recommended.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURLOTdXVF9RRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDK97WT_QE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Don Aleshire", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2023-06-22T18:52:38Z", review: "It is tough finding a solid electrician in Chicago who is willing to work on smaller jobs. Very lucky to have worked with the Highlights Chicago Electrical Services team. Both Raul and Cesar took care of the job same day, in and out before lunch. Incredibly fair pricing too. They are my go to electrical team moving forward.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNKbkkydmtBRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICJnI2vkAE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Manuel Rocha", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2022-06-16T23:01:25Z", review: "These guys are awesome! They were recommended to me by a friend when I needed to put in a 240V outlet for a dryer. They were super friendly and helpful, had a fast turnaround and did a great job. I’m doing electrical work again this week and didn’t hesitate to call them again", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNPN2Rhdm5RRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICO7davnQE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Nichole Maschhoff", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2024-01-31T18:00:47Z", review: `5 STARS!!!!! Boz was referred to us by a very close friend to help in what we considered an emergency situation on a Sunday afternoon when an OLD ADT system's battery back up decided to fail in our condo. We knew the building we purchased and moved into 8 months ago had an old ADT system but was told its not hooked up and doesn't actually work. Yesterday, a Sunday, we experienced the worst possible issue when the alarm system decided it would go off to let us know the battery back up was dying. We didn't know where the sound was coming from initially and frantically tried changing all the batteries in our smoke detectors and carbon monoxide detectors but the alarm was still going off with no reprieve deafening mine, my husbands and my puppy's ears. Boz immediate answered my call after having no idea who I was and started helping us with suggestions. We started FaceTiming and checking everything that could possibly be the cause of the sound narrowing it down to the old 12x12 inch ADT wiring box inside our Washer/Dryer closet. After about 10 minutes, cutting wires and pulling old/unnecessary alarm boxes from the walls, we weren't any closer to an answer or relief and Boz immediately said, "I'll be over there ASAP to help you". We're so thank for for him to come that quickly and he definitely helped save our sanity. We will definitely use Boz and Hightlights Chicago for any planned and or unplanned electrical work in the future for all our residential electrician, installation and/or wiring needs.`, review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUN0by0yMDFnRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICto-201gE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Nicholas Stone", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2019-04-08T04:11:41Z", review: "We originally thought remodeling our kitchen would just involve changing a few receptacles, but soon discovered that the wiring in our 135-year old house was badly in need of upgrading. Boz came up with a good, comprehensive, but reasonably priced proposal, and Zoran implemented it all very professionally, along with many other services. We will be sure to go back to them in the future, and have no hesitation in recommending Highlights Chicago to anyone looking for a good electrician in the Chicago area.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNZd3NmRlNREAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICYwsfFSQ%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Martin Syla", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2020-06-24T04:59:06Z", review: "I had a great experience with Highlights Chicago. This is a well-run company. Ben, our electrician on this project, is a highly skilled professional who was able to make our vision of kitchen remodel come to life. I feel comfortable recommending this company to anyone who needs professional electrical work done right.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUM4Nk5lQkZREAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIC86NeBFQ%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Stephanie S.", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2024-02-02T13:58:44Z", review: "Juve and Martin were fantastic! Professional, friendly, efficient, they did a high quality job and left absolutely no mess! This was my first time doing electrical work in any home and the entire team made it easy, digestible, and affordable.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUR0aE5laW1RRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDthNeimQE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Dan Leisten", rating: "2.0", iso_date: "2021-11-01T14:07:53Z", review: `Make sure you discuss the feasibility of the installation PRIOR to agreeing to have them come out.  I wanted to replace an existing chandelier with a 6 inch canned light to exactly match all the other canned lights in the room.  I sent photos of the existing canned lights and the chandelier.  When they arrived, the technician didn't even bring materials for a canned light and instead brought a DIY type "bathroom" style light instead, so they knew the installation of a canned light wouldn't have worked because of this adjacent vent and didn't communicate that to me.  They still charged me with the full $185 minimum house call fee in addition to the material of the fake light, when I could have just gone to home depot and bought it and installed myself in an hour.`, review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNHMGZ1QzNnRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICG0fuC3gE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Eduardo Antonio Farillo", rating: "1.0", iso_date: "2024-03-16T21:33:54Z", review: "I was excited by the opportunity to work with Highlights Chicago based on their great reviews. Unfortunately, I had an early morning consultation scheduled with one of their electricians and he never showed up. He did call a few hours later to schedule for later that same day. He still didn't show up for the later time window. I'm not quite sure what went wrong, but was left felling pretty disappointed.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQ5enZtMDlBRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgID9zvm09AE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Abby Cudia", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2019-06-18T17:24:52Z", review: "This company was very professional. I was the point of contact for City Church Chicago and they came to take out our fixtures and cover up the wires. Raul was the tech that came through and he was very kind. He represented the company so well. They were really quick to contact me via call and text. We are definitely using them again!", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURFb3F6alZ3EAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDEoqzjVw%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "liz drady", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2020-08-06T17:20:06Z", review: "As an Interior Decorator, smaller electrical jobs come with the territory. Highlights has been fabulous to me and my clients. I can feel confident that my clients will be treated fairly, with respect, professionally, and most importantly the job will be done correctly. Even if your budget is tight, electric is something you need done correctly!! Feel safe and confident when choosing Highlights Chicago.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNDd01Pc1lBEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICCwMOsYA%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Derrick Hamilton", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2020-06-11T23:06:59Z", review: "Due to the storms Tuesday, a neighbor's tree fell in our yard and took down our powerlines and weatherhead. Wednesday morning left us scrambling to find a good electrician on short notice as our ComEd technicians informed us it was on us to have our weatherhead repaired.  After calling around to several places that had decent reviews, but couldn't guarantee availability, we received a recommendation from a different electrical service company to contact Boz and co at Highlights. Boz was courteous, and punctual and was able to get to me, give me a fair quote, and have Ben, his electrician, get the repair done by early afternoon.  Ben did fantastic, quick work! And the staff at the office was incredibly cordial!  All in all, I will definitely be reaching out to Highlights for any future electrical work. When a completely different company recommends another, and they do well priced, fast, professional work, its clear you should continue to work with them always.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURjOXBQTk9BEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDc9pPNOA%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Eduardo Camacho", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2022-12-29T17:24:39Z", review: "We have called on Highlights for multiple projects since moving into our home and they are simply the best. We had a great experience with our technician Oscar, and the whole Highlights team. They are the only team we will be calling moving forward!", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNCbWVHZGlnRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICBmeGdigE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Dan Rosenberg", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2023-04-01T02:33:20Z", review: "These guys were pros from the start. Boz was helpful and gave a fair estimate. They worked with me on timing of the project and did a great job with the install. Don’t hesitate to call them.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNSbHVMb0h3EAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICRluLoHw%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Gianni Maffeo", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2023-06-06T19:48:23Z", review: "Highly recommend. Did work to upgrade electrical panel and were the best priced after multiple quotes. Used them after that for installing multiple chandeliers. Quick, efficient, get it done type staff that is very fairly priced.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUR4LXE3LWNnEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDx-q7-cg%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Rachel Claff", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2021-10-15T17:45:25Z", review: "Electricians were prompt, speedily repaired my DIY botch on a light fixture, and took careful COVID safety precautions. They even put together the fiddly new IKEA fixture for me. They (and the staff on the phone) were super friendly and responsive. I'll definitely call on them for any other lighting needs!", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQ2bjdXUEZBEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgID6n7WPFA%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "blr", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2023-12-20T02:56:32Z", review: "Boz and crew were awesome.  We did a service upgrade from 60A, while I was out of state.  Boz was very patient, answered all of my questions via phone, text, email.  The price was also very good, and his crew did a great job.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUMxZ0p1bUJnEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIC1gJumBg%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Ryan Pyka", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2022-01-11T21:24:40Z", review: "Highlights Chicago did an awesome job installing two new GFCI outlets in the basement of our two-flat for our new washer and dryer. Great local family owned and operated company to work with! The service manager, Boz, came out quick and provided an estimate. Our electrician, Jimmy, did the job in a timely manner. This company takes pride in what they do and it shows.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNtNTRTa3Z3RRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICm54SkvwE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Mark Heggeland", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2022-12-15T17:20:43Z", review: "Needed to get a bathroom fan replaced. Reached out Monday afternoon, everything was finished Wednesday morning. Their team showed up ahead of schedule and- even though they had to cut some drywall out of the ceiling- they left the bathroom clean. The fan also works great. Good crew- would use again.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNCaVBlcnlBRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICBiPeryAE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Chesney Gregorie", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2021-12-22T23:33:16Z", review: "My husband and I bought our first house this year, and the electricity was crumbling at best. There were rooms and closets with no overhead fixtures at all. To top of off, our electrical box on our exterior was not up to code for reasons I won’t get into it here. To sum it up, our house was a huge undertaking. Baz came to our house and was very pleasant, as we walked through room by room. He took notes, and even returned promptly in the next couple of days when we got cold feet on some of our decisions (where to relocate ext box). He assured us everything was going to look great, and that our ideas, some feeling too big to take on, we’re achievable and would be no problem. Not only that, he cleaned up and removed old cords so that we didn’t have a rats nest going to the alley. Amazing! His team, led by Cristobal and Kaplan, and spent about 2-3 weeks working incredibly hard in our house, in the heat of the summer, and full of dust. They added 100 amp circuit, a new electrical box, circuit board, replaced all switches and outlets, and added all my custom overhead fixtures with such care and precision. They were gracious, and patient when I changed my mind on things and added switches, ect. They kept a steady pace the whole time, and were so polite about coming back to our house when light fixtures arrived after our first large initial push. I would 100% recommend them to my friends and anyone else wondering if these guys are the ones for the job. They sure are!", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNtNHByVWpBRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICm4prUjAE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Jay Sanders", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2020-10-30T19:37:16Z", review: "During the excavation work as part of our pool project, the electrical feed from the house to the garage was severed.  The concrete was going to be poured in 2 days, so I needed the electrical work done quickly.  Boz came by within an hour to assess the situation.  He sent me an email with a fair quote that night.  His team, including Rolando, came the next day and worked on parallel with the concrete crew.  They finished the job in 2 hours.  Amazing service!!!", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNpaHFIbzl3RRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICihqHo9wE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Gina Vanasco", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2023-08-10T02:09:49Z", review: "I was so glad I met Boz and Raul of Highlights Chicago Electrical. They were professional, easy to work with, careful, and cared about the quality of their work. I could write a book about all the unprofessional, incompetent, and lazy tradespeople I have encountered in the past. How I wish I had known about Highlights Chicago sooner and saved myself some trouble and frustration.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNwczZxUzdnRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICps6qS7gE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "J H", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2021-12-14T17:32:18Z", review: "Niki in the office is very helpful, great communicator, the electricians that did the job were great as well, professional, respectful, good experience all around. I've already scheduled this company back for more electrical jobs. Highly recommend. They changed out an old range hood for a new.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNtZ0lMbld3EAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICmgILnWw%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Katherine O'Brien", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2019-10-30T13:08:41Z", review: "Highlights Chicago has the brilliant expertise required to work fast, be reliable, communicative, and save you time, hassle and money. Their combined level of experience amongst their technicians and the owner leads them to be able to quickly assess, strategize, troubleshoot and problem solve to deliver fast, thorough, cost-savings solutions. Highlights is industry-recommended by insiders and their fellow companies for a reason: they're amazing. Owner Boz answers the phone himself while out in the field because he cares about delivering phenomenal customer service.  My HOA had a complex electrical problem and had been ditched or ghosted by the Board's previously employed electricians who found the problem too complex, and too difficult to solve without a massive expense to the HOA that would have required a special assessment. Within MINUTES, Highlights' brilliant owner Boz was able to assess the situation, strategized a clear game plan, was provide an estimate for work that other electricians were not capable of estimating, and then came to the site himself again when he brought his team out to deliver results.  His team, Ben and Darrell, were able to quickly trouble shoot, assess the scope of work needed for the complex problem the HOA was facing with an aging system, and come up with a fast solution that made everyone happy and saved the HOA a ton of money.  Ben and Darrell quickly restored power to our complex that had been out for 4 months at a fraction of the estimated time and materials cost that others -- who were clearly out of their depth -- were estimated. Highlights Chicago has the experience and expertise worth every penny because the peace of mind they gave us was priceless.  Hope to make Highlights our HOA's go-to regular electrician and will be recommending them throughout the city to everyone I know.  Thank you Boz! Thank you Ben and Darrell! You're the best!", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQwc3ZqMG93RRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgID0svj0owE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Lori Hess", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2021-07-20T19:09:44Z", review: "Highlights Chicago was amazing!  I needed the coach lights on my home replaced, and they came out in one hour, got the job done efficiently and professionally!  Will definitely use them again and recommend them to anyone needing an electrician!", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNhd08yOXR3RRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICawO29twE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "M Kearns", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2021-09-10T15:36:42Z", review: "We hired Highlights to bring out more electricity to our garage and install new lights and outlets. They were responsive to calls, questions and did a great job. We'd definitely hire them again.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUM2N2ZHQWpnRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIC67fGAjgE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Chris Johnson", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2023-01-30T20:18:49Z", review: "Highlights was amazing from start to finish. Boz was not only prompt, but got the work done immediately at a fraction of a quote I received from a competing company. The entire team worked quickly and efficiently. Mile was also a big help in the process. I would 100% use Highlights again.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURCNTl1aVl3EAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDB59uiYw%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Airregina Clay", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2022-12-08T22:22:05Z", review: "Oscar and Julio came out to assess electrical issues in my apartment, and they were very professional, courteous, and thorough in their inspection and evaluation. I appreciate them taking the time to explain electrical terms to me in layperson's terms. I would definitely recommend Highlights Chicago Electrical Services to family and friends!", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQtMDdlNDdRRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgID-07e47QE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Andrew L", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2022-07-17T17:46:54Z", review: "Highlights send 2 of their guys and already they identified the problems with our flickering lights. Our household lacked electrical grounding all these years without me realizing it. We scheduled an appointment. They got here on time and finish their work within 2 days. So far, no flickering lights. Quite professional. Recommend.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURPbl9IWUp3EAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDOn_HYJw%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Steph", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2022-11-21T21:54:59Z", review: "Beautiful work. Cost efficient. And take pride in their craft. They addressed all my concerns as a first time home buyer. Reliable and honest company. Would definitely recommend. Don't hesitate.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQtNVBMdDFRRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgID-5PLt1QE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Sasha", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2018-05-18T18:03:03Z", review: "Highlight Chicago I moved to my new condo and needed to install a chandelier in my dining room and a couple of new light fixtures. The electrician from Highlights Chicago was on time, well organized, knowledgeable, clean and friendly. He did a great job and did not make a mess. I must say - it surely was a pleasant  experience!", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURnaEtUbmZnEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDghKTnfg%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Yiwen Chu", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2024-11-12T16:53:14Z", review: "Very professional work, I asked them to replace an old dangerous small electric panel and they changed it to a super nice brand new one. Very efficient work and they clean up after the work, also they are very kind people. Highly recommend!", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQzdEstcHhRRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgID3tK-pxQE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "G Mancuso", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2020-11-05T23:34:06Z", review: "Have used Highlights twice now.  They are a great crew to work with.  They were thorough in there estimate, provided recommendations and options, professional, and on-time.  Not to mention very reasonable pricing.  Will definately use them again if we have any additional electrical needs.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNpa2IzWm5RRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICikb3ZnQE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Ryan Papeck", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2021-06-03T18:41:17Z", review: "Absolutely Amazing!  Contacted them through the website last night and got a call the next morning.   Got quoted better than anybody else. I accepted and they were at my house within the hour.  Very professional, courteous, and amazing!  Thank You for the exceptional work!  Thank You for the super fast turnaround time.  I can't thank you enough!  Will be working with you again soon!", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNxMnVHVk9BEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICq2uGVOA%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "KC Carter", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2025-02-03T21:15:39Z", review: "Honest, hardworking people, and diligent. 200 amp, 3 phase new electrical service installed; panels, meter, etc. just passed city inspection and very HAPPY. Gratitude for GREAT WORK Highlights Electrical. 👍🏽", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUNBNDVMOVVBEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgMCA45L9UA%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Sarah Jessop", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2021-08-25T16:57:10Z", review: "We called at 11:18pm about a room in our apartment not having power. Not only did they ask questions to make sure we couldn't fix it ourselves but they had someone on their way to us in less than an hour. about 30 minutes later the problem had been fixed - we called to ask if we could be taken off the schedule and they could not be more understanding. Kemal especially was incredibly nice, professional and I would use them again if we need anything in the future!", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURhbDdLT2VREAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDal7KOeQ%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Ruairi O'Connor", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2023-07-14T19:02:22Z", review: "The best home improvement company we have worked with, hands down. Quick to give us a quote, schedule the work, and get it done. From the customer service to the electricians this company is as good as it gets.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURKcXVpN3p3RRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDJqui7zwE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "David Romano", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2020-07-03T18:26:59Z", review: "Raul and Highlights Chicago were able to fix my 4-way dimmer switch super quickly! After submitting my information online, they were at my place 2 days later for the repair. I wouldn't hesitate to recommend these guys to anyone and I will definitely be calling them for my next project!", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUM4dXBPWV9BRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIC8upOY_AE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Michael Caruso", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2020-12-31T03:47:10Z", review: "Spectacular Service.  I am so thankful I called Highlights. Boz, and his team - Oskar and Rolando were everything and more.  I called to get a second opinion on installing a sub panel to power radiant heating for my floors (requiring two additional dedicated 240v lines). Boz informed me that the right way to do this would be relocating my box in my unit (was in a community basement). I thought we were looking at a week+ lead time and probably would need to sell my left kidney.  The team was able to complete in two days of work, four days in total from the moment I called them. Pricing was reasonable and absolutely worth the work.  I will recommend Highlights and this crew all day, every day. Thank you, Boz, Rolando, and Oskar; truly appreciate each of you and the hard work.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURTcWVYTG5BRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDSqeXLnAE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Dee Block", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2022-02-24T23:52:42Z", review: "Tenants needed that hateful detector chirp stopped so they could sleep. Highlights Chicago were quick to answer the phone, reach an electrician, arrange an almost immediate service after hours, and completed the job quickly and efficiently. Service rate was more than fair for this after hours service. Great team - going into my contacts for future needs.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNXLXQyX3Z3RRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICW-t2_vwE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Japheth Learn", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2023-08-31T19:42:41Z", review: "Jimmy was our electrican and he went above and beyond for us. We had multiple light fixtures that needed to be replaced and he took care of them all. He took the time to sort out our unique wiring situation (older house) and was considerate throughout the entire process.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURwcl8yekl3EAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDpr_2zIw%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Niki S", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2015-10-27T22:28:08Z", review: "Wow I'm thrilled at the work that was done in my place . I have a High-End salon in Chicago and Highlights did my lighting . I received 10 % off on my services because i got a lot of things done. The customer service was great as well and I received a christmas card from them with some chocolates. Im just getting around to writing this review because I returned to ask them about a new property that I was working on. They came out to the location and gave me a free estimate. Very happy with their service.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNRMEpDeHNRRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICQ0JCxsQE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Carmen Romero", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2021-10-06T16:55:12Z", review: "They were prompt, professional and I could not be more pleased with our project. We had upgraded our kitchen adding outlets, connections for range hood, relocating refrigerator, and under-cabinet lighting. I highly would recommend.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQ2MWRfM253RRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgID61d_3nwE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Arnold Coleman", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2021-03-05T22:49:11Z", review: "My experience with Highlights Chicago Electrical Services was nothing short of professional and knowledgeable.  Ben & Jerardo exemplify the skills and professional knowledge to handle your electrical needs.  With the electrical issues I was facing, they came and resolved my issues.  Thank you for fixing my problems.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUR5NXJ5dkJBEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDy5ryvBA%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Jenny Gordon", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2024-10-08T14:34:36Z", review: "Love Highlights Electrical! They installed a couple outlets and before that a bathroom fan for me.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURuemNDMnh3RRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDnzcC2xwE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "David Schultz", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2020-08-15T18:03:16Z", review: "I 99% of the time rely on friends and family to suggest a business like this.  Electrical work is scary important.  Bad work can literally kill you or burn your house down.  So, after no good suggestions on Facebook I did some research and carefully chose this business.  Two men showed up.  They were friendly enough.  Didnt explain much but thats ok.  I know nothing about it.  They upgraded my 240V for washer/dryer to a double grounded 240V.  Took 36 minutes.  They wiped away any dust.  $280 which from what I've read is fair for two insured electricians in Chicago.  I would recommend.  5 stars because it was quick.  They came here 13 hours after my call on a weekend.  They did the job and did it right.  They arrived inside the 2 hour window.  Im happy. :)", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNDM0syMnJ3RRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICC3K22rwE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Joseph Basic", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2024-08-13T20:23:17Z", review: "Highly recommend for professional and reliable electrical work at very competitive prices. Ana and Iva from the office staff made scheduling a breeze. Will definitely use them again.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUM3X04yU3NBRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIC7_N2SsAE%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Kathleen Furore", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2020-02-28T03:39:12Z", review: "I could not be happier with the work Raul did installing 2 ceiling light fixtures! He was prompt, pleasant, and did terrific work in a short period of time. Highlights is now our go-to business for any future electric needs.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURzNHFUNkR3EAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDs4qT6Dw%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Haridas Attur", rating: "3.0", iso_date: "2021-11-01T00:35:13Z", review: "I was looking to get a fan installed on the ceiling. This place is one of the quotes I got. They were quick to respond , somebody also came down to look at the job and provided a quote within one day after the walkthrough. Good experience till here.  The quote was a bit high at $700 to install a fan.  But the biggest surprise was when he said he had to cut down the dry wall to install the fan on the ceiling. He said drywall would have to be opened up to install junction box. In addition he said that they dont patch the dry wall so once they install a junction box for the fan on the ceiling, I would the  have to call a handy man to patch the drywall OR I could patch the drywall after installing the fan.  He doesn't know that you can buy a junction box from Lowes that can fit into a small hole on the ceiling. The hole is easily covered by the top portion of the fan. I'm not sure whether he was taking me on a ride OR he just did not have an understanding on how to install a ceiling fan. In any case did not go with this company. Got another company for less than half the price plus no drywall patching or anything like that.  I did not really care about the price, but what surprised me is a company which has a 5/5 rating on google did not know that a ceiling fan could be installed without ANY drywall work- this was specific for this project. ( to note, wiring was already present from the lights nearby, and I was removing the lights , so no major wiring work was required for this job)", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChRDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNHNFpsSxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICG4ZlK%7C%7C?hl=en" }, { reviewer: "Joanne “kuhla”", rating: "5.0", iso_date: "2024-02-08T22:28:02Z", review: "BOZ is a credit to his profession. Highlights is a great overall company to work with. I cannot praise them enough. The ease of booking the service call, the punctuality, the ease of troubleshooting and problem solving.. all excellent.", review_link: "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUR0bi1xSzV3RRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae9382f0c0f6b3b!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDtn-qK5wE%7C%7C?hl=en" }];

